{"k": "46e368464a29a0a25bf26cb17b6f5984", "t": "Of course! Here are the lyrics to \"Gimme Shelter\" by The Rolling Stones:\n\nVerse 1:\nOh, a storm is threat'ning\nMy very life today\nOh yeah, I see\nEv'rybody having fun\nStayin' up all night\nHo, while the storm lasts\nOh yeah, I feel alive\n\nChorus:\nGimme shelter, gimme shelter\nOh, gimme shelter\nGimme shelter, gimme shelter\nOh, gimme shelter\n\nVerse 2:\nWar, children, it's just a shot away\nIt's just a shot away\nMama, mama, take this badge away\nMama, mama, can't you see\nThe storm is raging on\nOh yeah, I hear\nEv'rybody having fun\nStayin' up all night\nHo, while the storm lasts\nOh yeah, I feel alive\n\nChorus:\nGimme shelter, gimme shelter\nOh, gimme shelter\nGimme shelter, gimme shelter\nOh, gimme shelter\n\nBridge:\nOh, a voice is calling from far away\nWake you up in the middle of the night\nJust to hear those voices, oh yeah\nAnd to see that light\n\nChorus:\nGimme shelter, gimme shelter\nOh, gimme shelter\nGimme shelter, gimme shelter\nOh, gimme shelter\n\nOutro:\nOh, a storm is threat'ning\nMy very life today\nOh yeah, I see\nEv'rybody having fun\nStayin' up all night\nHo, while the storm lasts\nOh yeah, I feel alive."}
