{"k": "b55409e2874b25e95b8f9b23e56e5e5f", "t": "Here are the lyrics to \"Gimme Shelter\" by The Rolling Stones:\n\nWoke up this mornin', child, with my head full of pain\nDidn't know what time it was, didn't know where I'd been\nI stumbled out into the bright light of day\nAnd found myself in a world that's gone astray\n\nOh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh\nGimme shelter or give me some rain\nOh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh\nGimme shelter or give me some pain\n\nI'm a-goin' down to the crossroads, gonna get my baby back again\nI'm a-goin' down to the crossroads, gonna get my baby back again\nI'm a-goin' down to the crossroads, gonna get my baby back again\nGonna get my baby back again\n\nOh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh\nGimme shelter or give me some rain\nOh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh\nGimme shelter or give me some pain\n\nI'm a-goin' down to the crossroads, gonna get my baby back again\nI'm a-goin' down to the crossroads, gonna get my baby back again\nI'm a-goin' down to the crossroads, gonna get my baby back again\nGonna get my baby back again\n\nOh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh\nGimme shelter or give me some rain\nOh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh\nGimme shelter or give me some pain\n\n(Woman) Oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh\nOh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh\nOh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh\nOh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh\n\n(Mick Jagger) Oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh\nGimme shelter or give me some rain\nOh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh\nGimme shelter or give me some pain"}
