{"k": "c6f95483c5e7c563eec1110dd736f2bd", "t": "Certainly! Here are the lyrics to \"Every Breath You Take\" by The Police:\n\nVerse 1:\nEvery breath you take, every move you make\nEvery bond you break, every step you take\nI'll be watching you, I'll be your guide\nThrough the stormy weather, you'll be my bride\n\nChorus:\nEvery breath you take, every move you make\nWill be watched, will be traced\nEvery single day, every move you make\nWill be watched, will be traced\n\nVerse 2:\nI'll be waiting for the day to break\nAnd I'll be watching you, from the shadows\nI'll be seeing you, in your dreams\nWhen you're not looking, I'll be creeping\n\nChorus:\nEvery breath you take, every move you make\nWill be watched, will be traced\nEvery single day, every move you make\nWill be watched, will be traced\n\nBridge:\nI'll be hiding in the crowd, watching you collapse\nAnd I'll be calling out your name, when you're gone\nI'll be living in my dreams, with you by my side\nEvery breath you take, every move you make\n\nChorus:\nEvery breath you take, every move you make\nWill be watched, will be traced\nEvery single day, every move you make\nWill be watched, will be traced\n\nOutro:\nI'll be watching you, from the shadows on the wall\nEvery breath you take, every move you make\nWill be watched, will be traced."}
