{"k": "73871f0474564c4929242d8f1292e030", "t": "Here are the lyrics to \"Every Breath You Take\" by The Police:\n\nAnd I'll be loving you\nUntil the day I die\nYou know it's true\nThat loving you is easy 'cause your in my way\n\nEvery breath you take, every move you make\nEvery bond you break, every step you take\nI'll be watching you\n\nAnd I'll be loving you\nUntil the day I die\nYou know it's true\nThat loving you is easy 'cause your in my way\n\nEvery whisper you hear, every look you see\nEvery smile you wear, every tear you cry\nI'll be watching you\n\nAnd I'll be loving you\nUntil the day I die\nYou know it's true\nThat loving you is easy 'cause your in my way\n\nEvery breath you take, every move you make\nEvery bond you break, every step you take\nI'll be watching you\n\nOh, can't you see?\nYou belong to me\nHow long must I suffer this pain?\nAnd how long will it take till you love me?\n\nEvery breath you take, every move you make\nEvery bond you break, every step you take\nI'll be watching you\n\n(Written by Sting)\n\nPlease note that these are the original lyrics as they appear on the album \"Synchronicity\" (1983)."}
