{"k": "0fbba43d3c256ac9150a735da44cc077", "t": "Sure, here are the lyrics to \"Come Together\" by The Beatles:\n\nVerse 1:\nJump up, turn around, hear the band\nPlaying in the street, gonna be a groovy night\nHey, you, out there on the floor\nGet up and come along, you don't need no ticket to ride\n\nChorus:\nCome together, right now, over me\nHear the drummers pounding out a rhythm that's easy to see\nOh, yeah, I feel that magic in the air\nAnd I know that we can all show we care\n\nVerse 2:\nSee the sun going down, watch it shine\nFeel the breeze and the wind begin to blow\nHear the laughter of children at play\nAnd the sound of lovers in their own special way\n\nChorus:\nCome together, right now, over me\nHear the drummers pounding out a rhythm that's easy to see\nOh, yeah, I feel that magic in the air\nAnd I know that we can all show we care\n\nBridge:\nWe can work it out, oh yeah, we can work it out\nWe can work it out, oh yeah, we can work it out\n\nChorus:\nCome together, right now, over me\nHear the drummers pounding out a rhythm that's easy to see\nOh, yeah, I feel that magic in the air\nAnd I know that we can all show we care\n\nOutro:\nSo come on, come on, everybody get together\nCome on, come on, and let's all feel better\nLet's come together, right now, over me\nHear the drummers pounding out a rhythm that's easy to see."}
