{"k": "cee3fedaa2b4c3c99952842612e5ae95", "t": "Sure, here are the lyrics to \"Smooth\" by Santana:\n\nVerse 1:\nIt's been a long time, since I laid eyes on you\nThat smooth criminal smile, it's like a work of art\nYou got that thing that I can't resist\nAnd I can't help but feel the fire burning in my heart\n\nChorus:\nSmooth, smooth, smooth, smooth\nIt's like a crime, it feels so right\nSmooth, smooth, smooth, smooth\nGot me feeling like I'm in flight\n\nVerse 2:\nI can see the magic in your eyes\nAnd I can feel the heat of your love tonight\nYou got that thing that makes me wanna roll\nAnd I can't help but feel the fire burning in my soul\n\nChorus:\nSmooth, smooth, smooth, smooth\nIt's like a crime, it feels so right\nSmooth, smooth, smooth, smooth\nGot me feeling like I'm in flight\n\nBridge:\nI know you're the one, who can set my soul on fire\nAnd I know that I'll never be able to resist your desire\nYou got that thing that makes me wanna stay\nAnd I can't help but feel this way every single day\n\nChorus:\nSmooth, smooth, smooth, smooth\nIt's like a crime, it feels so right\nSmooth, smooth, smooth, smooth\nGot me feeling like I'm in flight\n\nOutro:\nSo let's keep on dancing, until the morning light\nAnd maybe we can find a place to call our own tonight\nYou got that thing that makes me wanna stay\nAnd I know that I'll never be able to resist your love every single day."}
