{"k": "728c107045eda68667e5da79c217f5df", "t": "\nVerse 1:\nI'm a pinball wizard, yeah I am\nBouncing off the walls of this cramped quarters cell\nI'm a pinball wizard, got my flippers on fire\nGonna bust outta here and take to the skies\n\nChorus:\nPinball wizard, oh yeah!\nI'm a pinball wizard, I'm in the zone\nPinball wizard, gonna light up the night\nGonna shine so bright, like a diamond in flight\n\nVerse 2:\nI'm a master of the flippers and the spin\nGot my eyes on the prize, gonna win\nI'm a pinball wizard, got my game on tight\nGonna bust through the glass ceiling tonight\n\nChorus:\nPinball wizard, oh yeah!\nI'm a pinball wizard, I'm in the zone\nPinball wizard, gonna light up the night\nGonna shine so bright, like a diamond in flight\n\nBridge:\nI'm on a roll, got my groove on tight\nGonna keep on bouncing till the morning light\nI'm a pinball wizard, I'm feeling alive\nGonna take this game to new heights and thrive\n\nChorus:\nPinball wizard, oh yeah!\nI'm a pinball wizard, I'm in the zone\nPinball wizard, gonna light up the night\nGonna shine so bright, like a diamond in flight"}
