{"k": "b3182c80e935b539344233cac8940a84", "t": "Sure, here are the lyrics to \"Killer Queen\" by Queen:\n\nVerse 1:\nShe's a killer queen, with a smile so sweet\nAnd when she takes the stage, you know she'll make it complete\nShe's got the body of a goddess, and the voice of an angel\nAnd when she sings, you know she'll make your heart go \"wow\"\n\nChorus:\nKiller queen, killer queen\nWith a smile so sweet and a voice so clean\nShe's got the whole town dancing in the street\nKiller queen, killer queen, can't you see?\n\nVerse 2:\nShe's got the moves like Jagger, and the face of an angel\nAnd when she struts her stuff, you know she's doing it well\nShe's got the whole crowd mesmerized, with just one look\nKiller queen, killer queen, she's got the hook\n\nChorus:\nKiller queen, killer queen\nWith a smile so sweet and a voice so clean\nShe's got the whole town dancing in the street\nKiller queen, killer queen, can't you see?\n\nBridge:\nShe's got the magic touch, and she knows just what to say\nAnd when she sings, you know she'll make your heart sing all day\nShe's got the whole crowd entranced, with just one look in her eye\nKiller queen, killer queen, she's got the prize\n\nChorus:\nKiller queen, killer queen\nWith a smile so sweet and a voice so clean\nShe's got the whole town dancing in the street\nKiller queen, killer queen, can't you see?\n\nOutro:\nSo if you ever see her, don't be shy\nJust go up and give her a try\nShe'll make your heart sing, and she'll make you feel so right\nKiller queen, killer queen, she's got the light."}
