{"k": "f108c02c010aedf702cd379ab9c0ba9f", "t": "Sure, here are the lyrics to \"I'm Still Standing\" by Elton John:\n\nVerse 1:\nI've been through the fire and I've been through the rain\nI've been broken, but I'm not the same\nI've been down, but now I'm coming up again\nAnd I'm still standing, yeah, still standing tall\n\nChorus:\nI'm still standing, yeah, still standing tall\nAfter all these years, I'm still on my feet\nAnd I'll keep on standing, till the end of time\nI'm still standing, yeah, still standing strong\n\nVerse 2:\nI've seen the best of times and I've seen the worst\nBut I'm still here, and I'm still in control\nI've been through the storm, but I've come out the other side\nAnd I'm still standing, yeah, still standing tall\n\nChorus:\nI'm still standing, yeah, still standing tall\nAfter all these years, I'm still on my feet\nAnd I'll keep on standing, till the end of time\nI'm still standing, yeah, still standing strong\n\nBridge:\nI've been through the fire and I've been through the rain\nBut I'm still here, and I'm still the same\nI've been broken, but I'm not the same\nAnd I'm still standing, yeah, still standing tall\n\nChorus:\nI'm still standing, yeah, still standing tall\nAfter all these years, I'm still on my feet\nAnd I'll keep on standing, till the end of time\nI'm still standing, yeah, still standing strong"}
