{"k": "8287286ec53525708b9b4ad124940ae4", "t": "Here are the lyrics to \"I'm Still Standing\" by Elton John:\n\nVerse 1:\nLove was an angry game\nAnd I never knew the rules\nBut now I do, and I know what to play\nAnd I'll play it loud and proud and free\n\nChorus:\n'Cause I'm still standing after all this time\nPicking up the pieces of my broken heart\nAnd learning how to live again without you\n'Cause I'm still standing, yeah, yeah, yeah\n\nVerse 2:\nI used to think maybe we could make it so\nBut now I know that's just a lie\nYou can't have your cake and eat it too\nAnd I won't be the one who's left behind\n\nChorus:\n'Cause I'm still standing after all this time\nPicking up the pieces of my broken heart\nAnd learning how to live again without you\n'Cause I'm still standing, yeah, yeah, yeah\n\nBridge:\nI'm still standing, yeah, yeah, yeah\nI'm still standing, yeah, yeah, yeah\n\nChorus:\n'Cause I'm still standing after all this time\nPicking up the pieces of my broken heart\nAnd learning how to live again without you\n'Cause I'm still standing, yeah, yeah, yeah"}
