{"k": "370a0bc73ecf8c9e57adad7a84cfa572", "t": "Of course! Here are the lyrics to \"Enter Sandman\" by Metallica:\n\nIn the darkness, I hear his voice\nA whisper in my ear, a chance to rise\nFrom the depths of hell, he's come to claim\nHis patience has its limits, he's standing in the hall\n\nHe's the king of the night, ruler of the land\nThe one they call the sandman, with his hands on your command\nHe's the one who brings the dreams that you've been chasing\nAnd when he speaks, the dead rise, and the living are amazed\n\nHis eyes are black as coal, his face is deathly pale\nThe grin on his face, it's a snarl, it's a wail\nHe's got a plan for you, and it ain't no lie\nYou're gonna be the king of the night, when he says goodbye\n\nSo enter sandman, bring me my dreams\nIn the darkness, I'll be waiting, it seems\nThe sands of time, they keep on slipping away\nAnd I'm still waiting, for the dawn to break\n\nHe's the one who brings the nightmares, and the fears\nThe one who brings the screams, and the tears\nBut when he speaks, the dead rise, and the living are amazed\nAt the power of his voice, at the end of the day\n\nSo enter sandman, bring me my dreams\nIn the darkness, I'll be waiting, it seems\nThe sands of time, they keep on slipping away\nAnd I'm still waiting, for the dawn to break"}
