{"k": "82e55957080deb6daddac556bee29609", "t": "Here are the lyrics to \"Black Magic Woman\" by Santana:\n\nVerse 1:\nShe's a black magic woman,\nAnd she's got the magic in her eyes\nShe's a black magic woman,\nAnd she'll take you to the other side\n\nChorus:\nOh, oh, oh, she's a black magic woman\nOh, oh, oh, she's got the magic in her eyes\nOh, oh, oh, she's a black magic woman\nOh, oh, oh, she'll take you to the other side\n\nVerse 2:\nShe's got the power of the night\nAnd she'll make your heart take flight\nShe's got the secrets of the earth\nAnd she'll show you what you're worth\n\nChorus:\nOh, oh, oh, she's a black magic woman\nOh, oh, oh, she's got the magic in her eyes\nOh, oh, oh, she's a black magic woman\nOh, oh, oh, she'll take you to the other side\n\nBridge:\nShe's a mystery, she's a wonder\nAnd she'll leave you in a spin\nShe's a black magic woman, oh yeah\nAnd she'll make your heart sing\n\nChorus:\nOh, oh, oh, she's a black magic woman\nOh, oh, oh, she's got the magic in her eyes\nOh, oh, oh, she's a black magic woman\nOh, oh, oh, she'll take you to the other side\n\nOutro:\nShe's a black magic woman, oh yeah\nAnd she'll make your heart sing\nShe's a black magic woman, oh yeah\nAnd she'll take you to the other side."}
