{"k": "059c1b06854c6b43d83370b3bcfae90f", "t": "Sure, here are the lyrics to \"Jolene\" by Dolly Parton:\n\nVerse 1:\nI'm a-sittin' on my front porch swing, starin' at the fields of gold\nDreamin' of the day when I can leave this ol' town behind\nAnd I'll never forget the night we met, Jolene, oh how you shined\nWith your red hair and green eyes, like a wildfire in the sky\n\nChorus:\nJolene, Jolene, my heart is mine\nJolene, Jolene, you're still on my mind\nI'm beggin' of you, please don't take my man\nHe's all I got, he's all I need, oh Jolene\n\nVerse 2:\nYou've got a smile that's sweet as apple pie, and a laugh that's contagious\nBut I can't help but feel a little jealous, every time I see you with him\nI know he don't love me like he loves you, but I can't help how I feel\nAnd I'll never forgive myself if I lose him, oh Jolene, please don't make me steal\n\nChorus:\nJolene, Jolene, my heart is mine\nJolene, Jolene, you're still on my mind\nI'm beggin' of you, please don't take my man\nHe's all I got, he's all I need, oh Jolene\n\nBridge:\nI know I'm just a simple girl, from a simple town\nBut I've got a heart that's full of love, and a soul that's on the ground\nAnd I'll never give up on my man, no matter what you do\nOh Jolene, please don't take him away from me, I'll never be through\n\nChorus:\nJolene, Jolene, my heart is mine\nJolene, Jolene, you're still on my mind\nI'm beggin' of you, please don't take my man\nHe's all I got, he's all I need, oh Jolene"}
{"k": "4d673f3bd37f726818376c052bb59235", "t": "Sure, here are the lyrics to \"Jolene\" by Dolly Parton:\n\nVerse 1:\nI'm a-sittin' on my front porch swing, starin' at the fields of gold\nDreamin' of the day when I can leave this ol' town behind\nAnd I'll never forget the night we met, Jolene, oh how you shined\nWith your red hair and green eyes, like a wildfire in the sky\n\nChorus:\nJolene, Jolene, my heart is mine\nJolene, Jolene, you're still on my mind\nI'm beggin' of you, please don't take my man\nHe's all I got, he's all I need, oh Jolene\n\nVerse 2:\nYou've got a smile that's sweet as apple pie, and a laugh that's contagious\nBut I can't help but feel a little jealous, every time I see you with him\nI know he don't love me like he loves you, but I can't help how I feel\nAnd I'll never forgive myself if I lose him, oh Jolene, please don't make me steal\n\nChorus:\nJolene, Jolene, my heart is mine\nJolene, Jolene, you're still on my mind\nI'm beggin' of you, please don't take my man\nHe's all I got, he's all I need, oh Jolene\n\nBridge:\nI know I'm just a simple girl, from a simple town\nBut I've got a heart that's full of love, and a soul that's on the ground\nAnd I'll never give up on my man, no matter what you do\nOh Jolene, please don't take him away from me, I'll never be through\n\nChorus:\nJolene, Jolene, my heart is mine\nJolene, Jolene, you're still on my mind\nI'm beggin' of you, please don't take my man\nHe's all I got, he's all I need, oh Jolene"}
