{"k": "7d16effa18b9192a25e1f9b07440bab4", "t": "Sure, here are the lyrics to \"Rocket Man\" by Elton John:\n\nVerse 1:\nI'm a rocket man, burning out my fuse up here alone\nExcepting I'm not alone\nOh, I've got my hands in my pockets and my head is spinning around\nAnd I'm feeling like I'm floating in a most peculiar way\n\nChorus:\nI'm a rocket man, burning out my fuse up here alone\nMaking my way into the sun\nOh, I've got my sights on the moon and I'm feeling like I'm getting near\nAnd I'm feeling like I'm floating in a most peculiar way\n\nVerse 2:\nI'm a rocket man, burning out my fuse up here alone\nAnd I've got my eyes on the stars and they're shining bright\nOh, I've got my heart filled with hope and my soul is taking flight\nAnd I'm feeling like I'm floating in a most peculiar way\n\nChorus:\nI'm a rocket man, burning out my fuse up here alone\nMaking my way into the sun\nOh, I've got my sights on the moon and I'm feeling like I'm getting near\nAnd I'm feeling like I'm floating in a most peculiar way\n\nBridge:\nI'm a rocket man, burning out my fuse up here alone\nAnd I'm feeling like I'm flying to the moon\nOh, I've got my heart filled with hope and my soul is taking flight\nAnd I'm feeling like I'm floating in a most peculiar way\n\nChorus:\nI'm a rocket man, burning out my fuse up here alone\nMaking my way into the sun\nOh, I've got my sights on the moon and I'm feeling like I'm getting near\nAnd I'm feeling like I'm floating in a most peculiar way"}
