{"k": "67b848c7b698ac5272bf8107a933da06", "t": "Sure, here are the lyrics to \"Under the Bridge\" by Red Hot Chili Peppers:\n\nVerse 1:\nI woke up this mornin', feelin' like a ghost\nNo one knowin' where I've been or what I've lost\nI'm just a soul who's livin' in a world that's cold\nAnd I'm just tryin' to find my way back home\n\nChorus:\nUnder the bridge, I found a home\nWhere the light of love is never gone\nUnder the bridge, I found a place to hide\nFrom the world outside, where the darkness resides\n\nVerse 2:\nI've been around the world, but it ain't my home\nI'm just a stranger in this world alone\nI've seen the sights and heard the cries\nBut I can't find no peace in these eyes\n\nChorus:\nUnder the bridge, I found a home\nWhere the light of love is never gone\nUnder the bridge, I found a place to hide\nFrom the world outside, where the darkness resides\n\nBridge:\nI'm just a man, tryin' to find my way\nIn this crazy world, where the nights are long and gray\nBut under the bridge, I found a light\nA beacon in the dark, shinin' so bright\n\nChorus:\nUnder the bridge, I found a home\nWhere the light of love is never gone\nUnder the bridge, I found a place to hide\nFrom the world outside, where the darkness resides\n\nOutro:\nSo if you ever need a friend, just give me a call\nAnd I'll be there in a hurry, to catch you when you fall\nUnder the bridge, we'll find our way\nTo a brighter day, where the light will always stay."}
