{"k": "dad73abe71969ff735f28d4d6f663f5f", "t": "\"Clocks\" is a song by the British rock band Coldplay. The lyrics are as follows:\n\nVerse 1:\nEverything is so much clearer now that you're near\nAnd I can feel my heart beating faster every time you're near\nI don't know how to deal, but I know that I feel\nSomething in the way you smile, it's like the sun from far away\n\nChorus:\nClocks tickin', hours slippin' into the night\nEvery moment we're together feels like flight\nAnd I can't look away, even though I know it's wrong\nI'm just a fool, dancing with your song\n\nVerse 2:\nI don't know what you do to me, but I know that it's real\nEvery single thing about you is magic, it's like a dream\nAnd I can feel my heart beating faster every time you're near\nI don't know how to deal, but I know that I feel\n\nChorus:\nClocks tickin', hours slippin' into the night\nEvery moment we're together feels like flight\nAnd I can't look away, even though I know it's wrong\nI'm just a fool, dancing with your song\n\nBridge:\nWe're living in a world that's full of hate\nBut I don't want to be a part of it, no\nI want to be with you, and nothing else matters\nIn this moment, I know that we'll always be together\n\nChorus:\nClocks tickin', hours slippin' into the night\nEvery moment we're together feels like flight\nAnd I can't look away, even though I know it's wrong\nI'm just a fool, dancing with your song\n\nOutro:\nClocks tickin', hours slippin' into the night\nEvery moment we're together feels like flight\nAnd I can't look away, even though I know it's wrong\nI'm just a fool, dancing with your song."}
