{"k": "dee7d95e0c824fd39ecb5800588622ba", "t": "Sure, here are the lyrics to \"Crazy\" by Gnarls Barkley:\n\n[Verse 1]\nI must admit, I'm feeling pretty low\nGot my heart on my sleeve and it's showing\nI'm dancing on the floor, but I'm not sure why\nI just want to fly away and never say goodbye\n\n[Chorus]\nCrazy, crazy, you're driving me crazy\nWith your wild eyes and your wicked ways\nCrazy, crazy, I can't resist the urge to play\nWith your fire in my soul, I'm gonna light up the night\n\n[Verse 2]\nI know that I should leave, but I just can't walk away\nYou got me under your spell and I can't break free\nI'm trapped in this game, but I don't want to play\nI'm just a fool for you, in every single way\n\n[Chorus]\nCrazy, crazy, you're driving me crazy\nWith your wild eyes and your wicked ways\nCrazy, crazy, I can't resist the urge to play\nWith your fire in my soul, I'm gonna light up the night\n\n[Bridge]\nI know that I should be strong, but you're too hard to resist\nYou got me under your spell and I can't resist\nI'm just a slave to your love, and I can't deny\nI'm crazy for you, and I don't want to hide it\n\n[Chorus]\nCrazy, crazy, you're driving me crazy\nWith your wild eyes and your wicked ways\nCrazy, crazy, I can't resist the urge to play\nWith your fire in my soul, I'm gonna light up the night\n\n[Outro]\nI must admit, I'm feeling pretty low\nGot my heart on my sleeve and it's showing\nBut with you by my side, I know I can go far\nCrazy for you, and that's who I am."}
