{"k": "edb286c8c7d62b3660e7bd5203022344", "t": "Sure, here are the lyrics to \"Viva La Vida\" by Coldplay:\n\nVerse 1:\nI used to rule the world\nSeas would rise when I gave the word\nNow in the morning I sleep alone\nSweep the streets I used to own\n\nChorus:\nViva la vida, ain't no one gonna break my stride\nViva la vida, still I rise\nViva la vida, is this the life?\nViva la vida, and I'll be free\n\nVerse 2:\nI used to roll the dice, feel the fear in my enemies' eyes\nNow in the night I hear their voices, they're singing bye-bye\nSaw myself, a replay of the fight\nAnd how I woke up, with the ghosts inside\n\nChorus:\nViva la vida, ain't no one gonna break my stride\nViva la vida, still I rise\nViva la vida, is this the life?\nViva la vida, and I'll be free\n\nBridge:\nI used to think that I was born to lose\nBut now the whole world is listening, as I use my voice\nAnd I'm not alone, no I'm not alone\nOh, oh, oh, oh, oh\n\nChorus:\nViva la vida, ain't no one gonna break my stride\nViva la vida, still I rise\nViva la vida, is this the life?\nViva la vida, and I'll be free\n\nOutro:\nI used to rule the world, seas would rise when I gave the word\nNow in the morning I sleep alone, sweep the streets I used to own."}
