{"k": "335db5424864cd8c5d1168f0fa8ad049", "t": "Here are the lyrics to \"Rolling in the Deep\" by Adele:\n\nThere's a fire starting in my heart\nReaching the places that it's never been before\nAnd I've got a long list of ex-lovers\nThey'll tell you I'm insane\n\nBut I've got a blank space, baby\nAnd I'll write your name\n\nWe could've had it all\nRolling in the deep\nYou played it cool, boy\nWhile I was losing control\nYou found a good spot to hide away\nWhile I fell apart\n\nThere's a fire starting in my heart\nReaching the places that it's never been before\nAnd I've got a long list of ex-lovers\nThey'll tell you I'm insane\n\nBut I've got a blank space, baby\nAnd I'll write your name\n\nWe could've had it all\nRolling in the deep\nYou played it cool, boy\nWhile I was losing control\nYou found a good spot to hide away\nWhile I fell apart\n\nI set fire to the night\nWatched it burn as the ashes grew\nHe called me up and he brushed his teeth\nAnd turns around, starts talking 'bout himself\nAnd I'm like, \"Oh, really? Oh, really?\"\n'Cause if you're half the man your ego says you are\nYou'd be a thousand times more handsome\n\nWe could've had it all\nRolling in the deep\nYou played it cool, boy\nWhile I was losing control\nYou found a good spot to hide away\nWhile I fell apart\n\nThere's a fire starting in my heart\nReaching the places that it's never been before\nAnd I've got a long list of ex-lovers\nThey'll tell you I'm insane\n\nBut I've got a blank space, baby\nAnd I'll write your name\n\nWe could've had it all\nRolling in the deep"}
