{"k": "1d3c428a4654259906b14cff6185c317", "t": "Sure, here are some lyrics for \"Get Lucky\" by Daft Punk featuring Pharrell Williams:\n\nVerse 1 (Daft Punk):\nWe're up all night to get lucky\nWe're feeling alive and ready to rock\nThe music is loud and the lights are low\nWe're gonna dance 'til the morning light\n\nChorus (Pharrell Williams):\nGet lucky, get lucky, get lucky tonight\nWe're feeling alright, we're feeling alive\nGet lucky, get lucky, get lucky tonight\nWe're gonna make this night unforgettable\n\nVerse 2 (Daft Punk):\nThe DJ is spinnin' a groove that's oh so fine\nWe're moving our bodies to the rhythm and time\nThe music is pumping and the crowd is feeling alive\nWe're gonna dance 'til the morning light\n\nChorus (Pharrell Williams):\nGet lucky, get lucky, get lucky tonight\nWe're feeling alright, we're feeling alive\nGet lucky, get lucky, get lucky tonight\nWe're gonna make this night unforgettable\n\nBridge (Daft Punk):\nThe lights are flashing and the energy is high\nWe're feeling alive and ready to fly\nWe're gonna dance 'til the morning light\nAnd we won't stop until the sun comes up tonight\n\nChorus (Pharrell Williams):\nGet lucky, get lucky, get lucky tonight\nWe're feeling alright, we're feeling alive\nGet lucky, get lucky, get lucky tonight\nWe're gonna make this night unforgettable\n\nOutro (Daft Punk):\nSo let's keep dancing and have a blast\nWe'll be getting lucky all night long at last\nThe music is loud and the lights are bright\nAnd we're feeling alive tonight."}
