ciples, such as diversification and patience, investors can create a powerful framework for building wealth over time.\"\n\nI hope you find this passage informative and helpful! Let me know if you have any questions or if you'd like me to generate another passage from \"The Intelligent Investor\" by Benjamin Graham."}
