a failed idea, lean startup entrepreneurs are trained to recognize when it's time to pivot and try something new.\n\nAnother important concept in the lean startup framework is the idea of 'validated learning.' This means that entrepreneurs should always be testing their assumptions about their business with real users, rather than relying on intuition or guesswork. By validating their ideas through experimentation and customer feedback, entrepreneurs can ensure that they are building a product that truly meets the needs of their target market."}
