ing principles isn't enough. You also need to be willing to apply them consistently, even when it's hard or uncomfortable. This is where discipline comes in. Discipline is the ability to stick to your principles, even when you don't feel like it. It's the ability to do what needs to be done, even when it's not easy.\n\nI've learned that discipline is essential for achieving my goals and living a fulfilling life. Without discipline, I would never have been able to build Bridgewater into the successful company it is today. And without discipline, I"}
