y revealed themselves to those who listened closely. And at the heart of it all was a competition, a game between two young magicians, Celia and Marco, each trying to outdo the other in a battle of wits and magic. It was a game that would last for years, one that would test their skills, their loyalty, and their very souls.\"\n\nI hope you enjoyed this passage!"}
