{"k": "5035b5eb0f7690456d693f9afb8728fc", "t": "You're likely thinking of a Unicorn!\n\nA unicorn is a mythical creature that has the body, mane, and tail of a horse, but with a single horn protruding from its forehead. The horn is often depicted as being white or shining, and it's said to have magical powers.\n\nUnicorns are featured in many mythologies and folklores around the world, including European folklore, Asian mythology, and Middle Eastern legends. They're often associated with purity, innocence, and magic, and are sometimes seen as a symbol of good luck or protection.\n\nIn modern times, unicorns have become a popular cultural phenomenon, appearing in children's books, movies, TV shows, and even fashion trends!\n\nSo, that's the mythical creature you were thinking of \u2013 a majestic, magical unicorn with a single horn!"}
