{"k": "f3985574a1ad0f06055321f90f4d16b3", "t": "Here are the lyrics to \"Every Breath You Take\" by The Police:\n\nEvery breath you take\nAnd every move you make\nEvery bond you break\nEvery step you take, I'll be watching you\n\nThere's no place for you to hide\nI'll get to you wherever you will run\nThat is my secret plan\n\nEvery single day and night\nI'll be watching you\n\nEvery line of every page\nYou turn it all to gold\nBut don't think for a moment that I'm fool enough to think\nIt lasts, it won't last\n\nEvery step you take, I'll be watching you\n\nThere's no place for you to hide\nI'll get to you wherever you will run\nThat is my secret plan\n\nEvery single day and night\nI'll be watching you"}
