{"k": "51c8aebab372f47ff7c853e20a866905", "t": "Here are the lyrics to \"Come Together\" by The Beatles:\n\nHere come old flat-top\nHe came groovin' up slowly\nHe got ju-ju stick in his back\nHe was not sleepy\nHe was too hungry\n\nC'mon, they've been known to change their minds\nYou know I read the news today, oh boy\nAbout a lucky man who made the world shine bright\nBut news didn't reach this town tonight\n\nHere come old flat-top\nHe came groovin' up slowly\nHe got ju-ju stick in his back\nHe was not sleepy\nHe was too hungry\n\nAh, here 'come old flat-top\nHe came groovin' up slowly\nHe got ju-ju stick in his back\nHe was not sleepy\nHe was too hungry\n\nCome together, right now\nOver me\n\nAh, ah, ah, ah, ah...\n\n(Note: These are the original lyrics as they appear on the album \"Abbey Road\". There may be slight variations in different versions or live performances of the song.)"}
