{"k": "5ce46b577dc68e85b810ffa1572cdd12", "t": "Here are the lyrics to \"I Like It\" by Cardi B, Bad Bunny, and J Balvin:\n\n[Intro: Cardi B]\nI like it, I like it\nI like it, I like it\nI like it, I like it\nI like it, I like it\n\n[Verse 1: Cardi B]\nI'm the queen of this throne\nGot my crown on, got my diamonds shinin'\nGot my squad with me, we gettin' it in\nWe poppin' bottles, we sippin' on that gin\nI'm a boss, I'm a star, I'm a superstar\nGot my own style, ain't nobody touchin' me\n\n[Chorus: Cardi B]\nI like it, I like it\nWhen you're gone, I like it\nWhen you're gone, I like it\nI like it, I like it\n\n[Verse 2: Bad Bunny]\nYo, yo, yo, I'm feelin' the vibe\nGot my eyes on you, got my hands on your side\nWe gettin' wild, we gettin' crazy\nWe poppin' bottles, we sippin' on that hazy\nI'm a king, I'm a star, I'm a superstar\nGot my own style, ain't nobody touchin' me\n\n[Chorus: Cardi B]\nI like it, I like it\nWhen you're gone, I like it\nWhen you're gone, I like it\nI like it, I like it\n\n[Bridge: J Balvin]\nAy, ay, ay, ay, ay\nI'm feelin' the rhythm, got my hips on fire\nGot my eyes on you, got my hands on your desire\nWe gettin' wild, we gettin' crazy\nWe poppin' bottles, we sippin' on that hazy\n\n[Chorus: Cardi B]\nI like it, I like it\nWhen you're gone, I like it\nWhen you're gone, I like it\nI like it, I like it\n\n[Outro: Cardi B]\nI like it, I like it\nI like it, I like it\nI like it, I like it\nI like it, I like it"}
