{"k": "0b5bac44a46567ec9cb1ea3804e7e122", "t": "Here are the lyrics to \"I Like It\" by Cardi B, featuring J Balvin and Bad Bunny:\n\n[Intro: Cardi B]\nYeah, yeah, yeah\nYeah, yeah, yeah\nYeah, yeah, yeah\n\n[Verse 1: Cardi B]\nLet's go, let's go, let's go\nI like it, I like it, I like it\nI'm a dinosaur, move to the left\nGet in formation, get in formation\n\n[Chorus: Cardi B]\nI like it, I like it, I like it\nI like it, I like it, I like it\nI like it, I like it, I like it\nI like it, I like it, I like it\n\n[Verse 2: J Balvin]\nAy, ay, ay, ay, ay\nI'm a dinosaur, move to the left\nGet in formation, get in formation\nI'm a dinosaur, move to the left\nGet in formation, get in formation\n\n[Chorus: Cardi B & J Balvin]\nI like it, I like it, I like it\nI like it, I like it, I like it\nI like it, I like it, I like it\nI like it, I like it, I like it\n\n[Verse 3: Bad Bunny]\nAy, ay, ay, ay, ay\nI'm a dinosaur, move to the left\nGet in formation, get in formation\nI'm a dinosaur, move to the left\nGet in formation, get in formation\n\n[Chorus: Cardi B & J Balvin]\nI like it, I like it, I like it\nI like it, I like it, I like it\nI like it, I like it, I like it\nI like it, I like it, I like it\n\n[Bridge: Cardi B]\nYeah, yeah, yeah\nYeah, yeah, yeah\nYeah, yeah, yeah\n\n[Outro: Cardi B]\nLet's go, let's go, let's go\nI like it, I like it, I like it\nI'm a dinosaur, move to the left\nGet in formation, get in formation.\n\nNote that these are just the main verses and choruses of the song. The actual song has additional elements such as ad-libs, instrumental breaks, and other features that aren't included here."}
