{"k": "3cdc79d9b695154eaf0a2560c3705061", "t": "Here are the lyrics to \"Thinking Out Loud\" by Ed Sheeran:\n\nVerse 1:\nWe were both young when I first saw you\nI close my eyes and the flashback starts\nI'm standing there on a hill alone\nIn the misty morning fog with the rain so heavy\n\nChorus:\nAnd you told me 'bout your past\nThinking out loud, thinking out loud\nYou know it used to be me\nThinking out loud, thinking out loud\n\nVerse 2:\nRemember when you hit the brakes too soon?\nTwenty stitches in a hospital room\nWhen we built a home and filled it up with memories\nAnd I heard the sound of my old records playing\n\nChorus:\nAnd you told me 'bout your past\nThinking out loud, thinking out loud\nYou know it used to be me\nThinking out loud, thinking out loud\n\nBridge:\nWe're standing knee-deep in a love so strong\nAnd we'll never let it go wrong\nWe'll take the good and bad and make it last\n'Cause when you're mine, I'm yours for life\n\nChorus:\nAnd you told me 'bout your past\nThinking out loud, thinking out loud\nYou know it used to be me\nThinking out loud, thinking out loud\n\nOutro:\nAnd we'll take the good and bad and make it last\n'Cause when you're mine, I'm yours for life\nWe'll take the good and bad and make it last\n'Cause when you're mine, I'm yours for life"}
