{"k": "1894cb92c2e2bbdb243a0544f5e4fb17", "t": "Here are the lyrics to \"Thinking Out Loud\" by Ed Sheeran:\n\n[Verse 1]\nWhen your legs don't work like they used to before\nAnd I'm not gonna lie, girl\nI still make you smile with the things I do\nAnd you know how much that means to me\n\n[Chorus]\n'Cause when I fell in love with you\nI never meant to cause you pain\nAnd all the times I hurt you\nAll the times I made you cry\n\n[Verse 2]\nWhen your legs don't work like they used to before\nAnd I'm not gonna lie, girl\nI still make you smile with the things I do\nAnd you know how much that means to me\n\n[Chorus]\n'Cause when I fell in love with you\nI never meant to cause you pain\nAnd all the times I hurt you\nAll the times I made you cry\n\n[Bridge]\nBut if I knew forever had you near\nOh, my life would be better than a dream\n\n[Chorus]\n'Cause when I fell in love with you\nI never meant to cause you pain\nAnd all the times I hurt you\nAll the times I made you cry\n\n[Outro]\nWhen your legs don't work like they used to before\nAnd I'm not gonna lie, girl\nI still make you smile with the things I do\nAnd you know how much that means to me.\n\nNote: These are the original lyrics as they appear on the album \"x\" (2014). There may be slight variations in different versions or live performances of the song."}
