{"k": "0b229037df4cbde793cc6855c43d1454", "t": "Here are the lyrics to \"Purple Rain\" by Prince:\n\n\"Purple rain, purple rain\nPurple rain, purple rain\"\n\n\"I only wanted to see you laughing in the purple rain\nI only wanted to see you laughing in the purple rain\"\n\n\"Purple rain, purple rain\nPurple rain, purple rain\"\n\n\"Just like the white dove, we were meant to be\nWe were young and free and full of life and full of energy\n\nPurple rain, purple rain\nPurple rain, purple rain\"\n\n\"I never wanted to be your weekend lover\nI only wanted to see you laughing in the purple rain\"\n\n\"Purple rain, purple rain\nPurple rain, purple rain\"\n\n\"Sometimes it's too hard with love, but I'll be loving you until the end of time\n\nPurple rain, purple rain\nPurple rain, purple rain\"\n\n\"I never wanted to be your weekend lover\nI only wanted to see you laughing in the purple rain\"\n\n\"Purple rain, purple rain\nPurple rain, purple rain\"\n\n(Note: These are the main lyrics to the song. There may be some slight variations depending on the version or live performance.)\n\n\"Purple Rain\" is a iconic song by Prince, released in 1984 as part of his album and film \"Purple Rain\". The song has become one of Prince's most popular and enduring songs, and its themes of love, loss, and redemption continue to resonate with listeners today."}
{"k": "2e73b68e07c18ec3d67db235d9a839c6", "t": "Here are the lyrics to \"Purple Rain\" by Prince:\n\n\"Purple rain, purple rain\nPurple rain, purple rain\"\n\n\"I only wanted to see you laughing in the purple rain\nI only wanted to see you laughing in the purple rain\"\n\n\"Purple rain, purple rain\nPurple rain, purple rain\"\n\n\"Just like the white dove, we were meant to be\nWe were young and free and full of life and full of energy\n\nPurple rain, purple rain\nPurple rain, purple rain\"\n\n\"I never wanted to be your weekend lover\nI only wanted to see you laughing in the purple rain\"\n\n\"Purple rain, purple rain\nPurple rain, purple rain\"\n\n\"Sometimes it's too hard with love, but I'll be loving you until the end of time\n\nPurple rain, purple rain\nPurple rain, purple rain\"\n\n\"I never wanted to be your weekend lover\nI only wanted to see you laughing in the purple rain\"\n\n\"Purple rain, purple rain\nPurple rain, purple rain\"\n\n(Note: These are the main lyrics to the song. There may be some slight variations depending on the version or live performance.)\n\n\"Purple Rain\" is a iconic song by Prince, released in 1984 as part of his album and film \"Purple Rain\". The song has become one of Prince's most popular and enduring songs, and its themes of love, loss, and redemption continue to resonate with listeners today."}
{"k": "25fc66c6a69043cc0a6a3b747399f38a", "t": "Here are the lyrics to \"Purple Rain\" by Prince:\n\n\"Purple rain, purple rain\nPurple rain, purple rain\"\n\n\"I only wanted to see you laughing in the purple rain\nI only wanted to see you laughing in the purple rain\"\n\n\"Purple rain, purple rain\nPurple rain, purple rain\"\n\n\"Just like the white dove, we were meant to be\nWe were young and free and full of life and full of energy\n\nPurple rain, purple rain\nPurple rain, purple rain\"\n\n\"I never wanted to be your weekend lover\nI only wanted to see you laughing in the purple rain\"\n\n\"Purple rain, purple rain\nPurple rain, purple rain\"\n\n\"Sometimes it's too hard with love, but I'll be loving you until the end of time\n\nPurple rain, purple rain\nPurple rain, purple rain\"\n\n\"I never wanted to be your weekend lover\nI only wanted to see you laughing in the purple rain\"\n\n\"Purple rain, purple rain\nPurple rain, purple rain\"\n\n(Note: These are the main lyrics to the song. There may be some slight variations depending on the version or live performance.)\n\n\"Purple Rain\" is a iconic song by Prince, released in 1984 as part of his album and film \"Purple Rain\". The song has become one of Prince's most popular and enduring songs, and its themes of love, loss, and redemption continue to resonate with listeners today."}
{"k": "6bb18e69c24285d37bde38de5eb88dd5", "t": "Here are the lyrics to \"Purple Rain\" by Prince:\n\n**Verse 1**\nI only hear my voice in that midnight song\nThere's a voice in the night, saying don't stop 'til you get enough\nIt's been callin' me friends, but I ain't been called yet\nI know not what for, but it's somewhere up above\n\n**Chorus**\nPurple rain, purple rain\nPurple rain, purple rain\n\n**Verse 2**\nSometimes I feel like a motherless child\nA long way from home\nBut then I'm only one of many children\nWho are after all, still young and free\n\n**Chorus**\nPurple rain, purple rain\nPurple rain, purple rain\n\n**Bridge**\nI only hear my voice in that midnight song\nThere's a voice in the night, saying don't stop 'til you get enough\nIt's been callin' me friends, but I ain't been called yet\nI know not what for, but it's somewhere up above\n\n**Chorus**\nPurple rain, purple rain\nPurple rain, purple rain\n\nNote: These are the original lyrics as they appear on the album \"Purple Rain\". There may be slight variations in different live performances or versions of the song."}
