{"k": "a0a3f791080d47d28fbeb951d26a77a3", "t": "Here are the lyrics to \"Single Ladies (Put A Ring On It)\" by Beyonc\u00e9:\n\n'Cause if you like it, then you shoulda put a ring on it\nIf you like it, then you shoulda put a ring on it\n\nDon't be gettin' none, unless you're gettin' some\nYou only need me when you're drunk as hell\nWhen I leave your ass for good, and go to the club\nAnd get more attention than you ever gave me, huh?\n\n'Cause if you like it, then you shoulda put a ring on it\nIf you like it, then you shoulda put a ring on it\n\nYou only need me when you're drunk as hell\nWhen I leave your ass for good, and go to the club\nAnd get more attention than you ever gave me, huh?\n\n'Cause if you like it, then you shoulda put a ring on it\nIf you like it, then you shoulda put a ring on it\n\nDon't be mad once you see that I'm gone\n'Cause if you like it, then you shoulda put a ring on it\nIf you like it, then you shoulda put a ring on it\n\n'Cause if you like it, then you shoulda put a ring on it\nIf you like it, then you shoulda put a ring on it"}
