{"k": "a64540ef8af69a9ed04a93f6fe15bffb", "t": "Here are the lyrics to \"Jolene\" by Dolly Parton:\n\nYour beauty is beyond compare\nWith flaming locks of auburn hair\nWith ivory skin and eyes of emerald green\nYour beauty is beyond denyin'\n\nJolene, Jolene, Jolene, Jolene\nI'm beggin' of you please don't take my man\n\nJolene, you're so lovely\nTell me, where have you been?\nI could rarely dance and sing\nBut since your man has gone away\n\nI can barely keep it in\nI'm beggin' of you please don't take my man\n\nYou could have your choice of men\nBut I could never love again\nHe's the only one for me, Jolene\n\nJolene, Jolene, Jolene, Jolene\nI'm beggin' of you please don't take my man\n\nI wish I could find out why\nYou went and left him, oh by and by\nAnd tell me somethin', is it some fancy man?\nOr did he just get tired of you too?\n\nJolene, Jolene, Jolene, Jolene\nI'm beggin' of you please don't take my man\n\nYou could have your choice of men\nBut I could never love again\nHe's the only one for me, Jolene\n\nJolene, Jolene, Jolene, Jolene\nI'm beggin' of you please don't take my man"}
{"k": "8ec852c02fbe2f48d80889a4fde91c5a", "t": "Here are the lyrics to \"Jolene\" by Dolly Parton:\n\nYour beauty is beyond compare\nWith flaming locks of auburn hair\nWith ivory skin and eyes of emerald green\nYour beauty is beyond denyin'\n\nJolene, Jolene, Jolene, Jolene\nI'm beggin' of you please don't take my man\n\nJolene, you could have your choice\nOf men, but I could never love again\nThey'd choose you, Jolene, they'd choose you\n\nBut Jolene, Jolene, Jolene, Jolene\nI'm beggin' of you please don't take my man\n\nYou could have your choice of anyone anywhere\nBut I could never love again\nThey'd choose you, Jolene, they'd choose you\n\nBut Jolene, Jolene, Jolene, Jolene\nI'm beggin' of you please don't take my man\n\nJolene, Jolene, Jolene, Jolene\nI'm beggin' of you please don't take my man"}
