{"k": "959221998587ad9027d474ee498888ad", "t": "Here are the lyrics to \"Burning Down the House\" by Talking Heads:\n\nPeople on the street, looking up above\nAre waiting for a sign of hope\nThe fire's burning down the house\nAnd I don't know what to do\n\nI'll take you to the place where we can be alone\nYou better not come home\nI'll take you to the place where we can be alone\nYou better not come home\n\nPeople on the street, looking up above\nAre waiting for a sign of hope\nThe fire's burning down the house\nAnd I don't know what to do\n\nI'll take you to the place where we can be alone\nYou better not come home\nI'll take you to the place where we can be alone\nYou better not come home\n\nPeople on the street, looking up above\nAre waiting for a sign of hope\nThe fire's burning down the house\nAnd I don't know what to do\n\nI'll take you to the place where we can be alone\nYou better not come home\nI'll take you to the place where we can be alone\nYou better not come home"}
