{"k": "95febf20f5807d363af8d6e387a43089", "t": "Here are the lyrics to \"Under the Bridge\" by Red Hot Chili Peppers:\n\nSometimes I feel like I don't have a partner\nSometimes I feel like my only friend\nIs the city I live in, the city of angels\nLonely as I am, together we cry\n\nI drive on her streets 'cause she's my companion\nI walk these streets 'cause they know who I am\nShe sees my good deeds and she kisses me windy\nShe takes me in and out of her light and she sets me free\n\nNow, here I stay\nSpending most of my time watching ships roll in\nAnd then go on their way again tonight\nAnd all I can do is wonder why\n\nIf heaven's under the streets and it looks like we might be getting close to it\nThen who am I to make it better?\nIf heaven's under the streets and it looks like we might be getting close to it\nThen who am I to make it better?\n\nSometimes I feel like I don't have a partner\nSometimes I feel like my only friend\nIs the city I live in, the city of angels\nLonely as I am, together we cry\n\nI drive on her streets 'cause she's my companion\nI walk these streets 'cause they know who I am\nShe sees my good deeds and she kisses me windy\nShe takes me in and out of her light and she sets me free\n\nNow, here I stay\nSpending most of my time watching ships roll in\nAnd then go on their way again tonight\nAnd all I can do is wonder why\n\nIf heaven's under the streets and it looks like we might be getting close to it\nThen who am I to make it better?\nIf heaven's under the streets and it looks like we might be getting close to it\nThen who am I to make it better?\n\nUnder the bridge, under the bridge\nUnder the bridge, under the bridge\n\n(Note: These are the original lyrics as they appear on the album \"Blood Sugar Sex Magik\". There may be slight variations in different versions or live performances of the song.)"}
