{"k": "b6d110b42cec0dcf0fb3abb3c2e25f8b", "t": "Here are the lyrics to \"Losing My Religion\" by R.E.M.:\n\nLyrics:\nI'll never bow down to them\nI'll never give in\nI'll never back down from them\nI'll never give in\n\nI'm trying to find my way\nThrough this world, through this life\nAnd I'm trying to find my place\nIn the world, in this life\n\nI'm trying to find my voice\nTo speak out loud and clear\nAnd I'm trying to find my strength\nTo stand up tall and proud\n\nI'll never bow down to them\nI'll never give in\nI'll never back down from them\nI'll never give in"}
