{"k": "1d4f9b43196b8ef6033f800828b52252", "t": "Here are the lyrics to \"Losing My Religion\" by R.E.M.:\n\nVerse 1:\nLife is bigger\nIt's bigger than you\nAnd you are not me\nThe lengths that I will go to\nThe distance in your eyes\nOh no, I've said too much\n\nChorus:\nI believe she when she told me\nI believe she said it\nOh well, whatever, yeah, whatever, yeah\nLosing my religion\n\nVerse 2:\nTrying to keep up with you and I don't know if I can\nDon't want to play this part\nIt's no solution\nThe world is a terrible place\nAnd the people in it are not nice\n\nChorus:\nI believe she when she told me\nI believe she said it\nOh well, whatever, yeah, whatever, yeah\nLosing my religion\n\nBridge:\nI don't know if I can do without it\nIt's for another day\nIt's no solution\nThe world is a terrible place\nAnd the people in it are not nice\n\nChorus:\nI believe she when she told me\nI believe she said it\nOh well, whatever, yeah, whatever, yeah\nLosing my religion"}
