{"k": "b69b8aa43c2e931fa2898ea2a3e02e6f", "t": "Here are the lyrics to \"No Scrubs\" by TLC:\n\n(Verse 1 - T-Boz)\nDon't play yourself, don't play yourself\nYou ain't got nothin' on me\nI'm a lady, I'm a lady\nAnd I know what you're thinkin'\nYou're thinkin', \"What's the deal with this chick?\"\nBut let me tell you somethin', boy\nI'm not that kind of girl\n\n(Chorus)\nNo scrubs, no scrubs\nDon't play yourself, don't play yourself\nNo scrubs, no scrubs\nDon't play yourself, don't play yourself\n\n(Verse 2 - Left Eye)\nYou got the nerve to say I'm a scrub?\nI ain't no scrub, I'm a ladybug\nAnd if you're thinkin' 'bout gettin' with me\nBetter come correct, better come correct\nOr you'll be gettin' left behind\nLike all the other scrubs in line\n\n(Chorus)\nNo scrubs, no scrubs\nDon't play yourself, don't play yourself\nNo scrubs, no scrubs\nDon't play yourself, don't play yourself\n\n(Bridge - Chilli)\nYou got the game on lock, you think you're so cool\nBut when it comes to me, you ain't got a clue\nI'm not that kind of girl, I'm not that kind of girl\nSo step your game up or take a hike, boy\n\n(Chorus)\nNo scrubs, no scrubs\nDon't play yourself, don't play yourself\nNo scrubs, no scrubs\nDon't play yourself, don't play yourself\n\n(Outro - All)\nNo scrubs, no scrubs\nDon't play yourself, don't play yourself\nNo scrubs, no scrubs\nDon't play yourself, don't play yourself"}
