{"k": "429daf2b4d604e4b5af0239892094da0", "t": "Here are the lyrics to \"No Scrubs\" by TLC:\n\nDon't get it twisted, don't get it twisted\nI'm not your typical girl and I deserve better than you know who\nYou're a scrub, a bum, a hunka hunka burnin' dumpster\nBut no, no, no, no, no\n\nDon't get it twisted, don't get it twisted\nI'm not your typical girl and I deserve better than you know who\nYou're a scrub, a bum, a hunka hunka burnin' dumpster\nBut no, no, no, no, no\n\nIf he can't take the time to talk all night\nThen he's outta my life, if it's not all right\nI'm not your typical girl and I deserve better than you know who\nYou're a scrub, a bum, a hunka hunka burnin' dumpster\nBut no, no, no, no, no\n\nDon't get it twisted, don't get it twisted\nI'm not your typical girl and I deserve better than you know who\nYou're a scrub, a bum, a hunka hunka burnin' dumpster\nBut no, no, no, no, no\n\nIf he can't take the time to talk all night\nThen he's outta my life, if it's not all right\nI'm not your typical girl and I deserve better than you know who\nYou're a scrub, a bum, a hunka hunka burnin' dumpster\nBut no, no, no, no, no\n\nDon't get it twisted, don't get it twisted\nI'm not your typical girl and I deserve better than you know who\nYou're a scrub, a bum, a hunka hunka burnin' dumpster\nBut no, no, no, no, no"}
{"k": "b0aed317812d012e809ccd70f65aad1a", "t": "Here are the lyrics to \"No Scrubs\" by TLC:\n\nDon't get it twisted, don't get it twisted\nI'm not your typical girl and I deserve better than you know who\nYou're a scrub, a bum, a hunka hunka burnin' dumpster\nBut no, no, no, no, no\n\nDon't get it twisted, don't get it twisted\nI'm not your typical girl and I deserve better than you know who\nYou're a scrub, a bum, a hunka hunka burnin' dumpster\nBut no, no, no, no, no\n\nIf he can't take the time to talk all night\nThen he's outta my life, if it's Saturday night and he can't see me then\nHe ain't on my grind, so here's a suggestion\nTake a hint, take a hint, 'cause I don't need this\n\nDon't get it twisted, don't get it twisted\nI'm not your typical girl and I deserve better than you know who\nYou're a scrub, a bum, a hunka hunka burnin' dumpster\nBut no, no, no, no, no\n\nIf he can't take the time to talk all night\nThen he's outta my life, if it's Saturday night and he can't see me then\nHe ain't on my grind, so here's a suggestion\nTake a hint, take a hint, 'cause I don't need this\n\nNo scrubs in the club, no scrubs in the club\nNo scrubs in the club, no scrubs in the club\nNo scrubs in the club, no scrubs in the club\nNo scrubs in the club, no scrubs in the club"}
