{"k": "65c78a843dc344db1ee603c870329968", "t": "Here are the lyrics to \"Still Alive\" by Jonathan Coulton:\n\nI'm not even supposed to be here after all\nI finished as I started, eating my shin\nEvery time I tried to win, I'd lose instead\nThere's no end to this dying, it just keeps going on and on\n\nI'm not even supposed to be here after all\nI finished as I started, eating my shin\nEvery time I tried to win, I'd lose instead\nThere's no end to this dying, it just keeps going on and on\n\nI'm not even supposed to be here after all\nI finished as I started, eating my shin\nEvery time I tried to win, I'd lose instead\nThere's no end to this dying, it just keeps going on and on\n\nI'm not even supposed to be here after all\nI finished as I started, eating my shin\nEvery time I tried to win, I'd lose instead\nThere's no end to this dying, it just keeps going on and on\n\n(Note: These are the original lyrics from Jonathan Coulton's song \"Still Alive\", which was written for the video game Portal. The song has since been covered by many other artists, but these are the original words as written by Coulton.)"}
