{"k": "50a8e70bee7acc92ce8ed3eb09cc5e4a", "t": "Here are the lyrics to \"99 Problems\" by Jay-Z:\n\nVerse 1:\nIf you're having girl problems, I feel bad for you son\nI got 99 problems but a bitch ain't one\nAin't no shorty in my section who thirty-one thousand strong\nI'm trying to keep it real, but your girl's got me wrong\n\nChorus:\nNigga, if you're having girl problems, I feel bad for you son\nI got 99 problems but a bitch ain't one\n\nVerse 2:\nIf my man can't get in, that's a whole 'nother problem\nIf he's trying to get with me, that's a whole 'nother problem\nIf he's trying to get with my homegirl, that's a whole 'nother problem\nIf he's trying to get with my homegirl and she say no, that's a whole 'nother problem\n\nChorus:\nNigga, if you're having girl problems, I feel bad for you son\nI got 99 problems but a bitch ain't one\n\nVerse 3:\nMy bike ain't been the same since I got it back\nMy chain is missing and my whip's in the shop\nMy man's in jail and my dog's on the run\nBut I'm still trying to get with your daughter, son\n\nChorus:\nNigga, if you're having girl problems, I feel bad for you son\nI got 99 problems but a bitch ain't one\n\nVerse 4:\nIf my man can't get in, that's a whole 'nother problem\nIf he's trying to get with me, that's a whole 'nother problem\nIf he's trying to get with my homegirl, that's a whole 'nother problem\nIf he's trying to get with my homegirl and she say no, that's a whole 'nother problem\n\nChorus:\nNigga, if you're having girl problems, I feel bad for you son\nI got 99 problems but a bitch ain't one"}
