{"k": "87790de99cbbcac10ec27dd4e4938a75", "t": "Here are the lyrics to \"99 Problems\" by Jay-Z:\n\n[Intro]\nYeah, yeah, yeah\nI don't know what they want from me\nI ain't got no 99 problems but a P and a D\n\n[Verse 1]\nMy bike, I like to ride it, ride it, ride it\nRide it, ride it, ride it, my bike\nMy bike, I like to ride it, ride it, ride it\nRide it, ride it, ride it, my bike\n\nI'm a young brother, ain't got nothin' but my peeps left\nTryna make that dough, tryna get that bread\nGot my eyes on the prize, tryna get ahead\nBut they keep on botherin' me, like I'm some kinda pest\n\n[Chorus]\n99 problems and a P and a D\n99 problems and a P and a D\n\n[Verse 2]\nMy bike, I like to ride it, ride it, ride it\nRide it, ride it, ride it, my bike\nMy bike, I like to ride it, ride it, ride it\nRide it, ride it, ride it, my bike\n\nI'm a young brother, ain't got nothin' but my peeps left\nTryna make that dough, tryna get that bread\nGot my eyes on the prize, tryna get ahead\nBut they keep on botherin' me, like I'm some kinda pest\n\n[Chorus]\n99 problems and a P and a D\n99 problems and a P and a D\n\n[Bridge]\nI don't know what they want from me\nI ain't got no 99 problems but a P and a D\n\n[Verse 3]\nMy bike, I like to ride it, ride it, ride it\nRide it, ride it, ride it, my bike\nMy bike, I like to ride it, ride it, ride it\nRide it, ride it, ride it, my bike\n\nI'm a young brother, ain't got nothin' but my peeps left\nTryna make that dough, tryna get that bread\nGot my eyes on the prize, tryna get ahead\nBut they keep on botherin' me, like I'm some kinda pest\n\n[Chorus]\n99 problems and a P and a D\n99 problems and a P and a D\n\nNote: These are the original lyrics as written by Jay-Z. There"}
