{"k": "277fe0e838f29a1c077ccc90888501d0", "t": "Here are the lyrics to \"Hurt\" by Johnny Cash:\n\nWhat have I become, my sweetest friend\nEveryone I know goes away in the end\nAnd I've come to realize\nThere's just nothin' left for me here\n\nI'll walk the line, hurt\nI tried to give you up when your love turned cold\nBut like a dog to its vomit, I just can't let go\nAnd I'm still trying to get used to this new life without you\n\nWhat have I become, my sweetest friend\nEveryone I know goes away in the end\nAnd I've come to realize\nThere's just nothin' left for me here\n\nI'll walk the line, hurt\nI tried to give you up when your love turned cold\nBut like a dog to its vomit, I just can't let go\nAnd I'm still trying to get used to this new life without you\n\nWhat have I become, my sweetest friend\nEveryone I know goes away in the end\nAnd I've come to realize\nThere's just nothin' left for me here\n\nI'll walk the line, hurt\nI tried to give you up when your love turned cold\nBut like a dog to its vomit, I just can't let go\nAnd I'm still trying to get used to this new life without you\n\nWhat have I become, my sweetest friend\nEveryone I know goes away in the end\nAnd I've come to realize\nThere's just nothin' left for me here"}
