{"k": "f452b8c481181c0886039aaf70c4794d", "t": "Here are the lyrics to \"Clocks\" by Coldplay:\n\nLook at the stars, look how they shine for you\nAnd everything you do, yeah, they were all made for you\nI had to find you, tell you I need you\nTell you I set you apart\nTell me your secrets, and ask me your questions\nOh, come on, oh, come along\n\nCome on, oh, come along\nClocks turn backwards\nSo quickly, quietly\nIn the mode you'll be in\nYou won't ever forget it\nYou know I'm always here\nAnd your shadow's the one that I fear\nYeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah\n\nLook at the stars, look how they shine for you\nAnd everything you do, yeah, they were all made for you\nI had to find you, tell you I need you\nTell you I set you apart\nTell me your secrets, and ask me your questions\nOh, come on, oh, come along\n\nCome on, oh, come along\nClocks turn backwards\nSo quickly, quietly\nIn the mode you'll be in\nYou won't ever forget it\nYou know I'm always here\nAnd your shadow's the one that I fear\nYeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah\n\nOh, oh, oh, oh, oh\nLook at the stars, look how they shine for you\nAnd everything you do, yeah, they were all made for you\nI had to find you, tell you I need you\nTell you I set you apart\nTell me your secrets, and ask me your questions\nOh, come on, oh, come along\n\nCome on, oh, come along\nClocks turn backwards\nSo quickly, quietly\nIn the mode you'll be in\nYou won't ever forget it\nYou know I'm always here\nAnd your shadow's the one that I fear\nYeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah"}
