{"k": "1fc5662353fc8ab53257a25124ed11f0", "t": "Here are the lyrics to \"Clocks\" by Coldplay:\n\n\"Look at the stars\nLook how they shine for you\nAnd everything you do\nLooks like it's made for you\n\nWere we meant to pretend again?\nThat somebody else would come along and make us feel this way?\nSomebody else will come along and make us feel this way?\n\nI don't know what I'm searching for\nBut I'll keep on searching till I find\nLook at the stars\nLook how they shine for you\n\nAnd everything you do\nLooks like it's made for you\n\nWere we meant to pretend again?\nThat somebody else would come along and make us feel this way?\nSomebody else will come along and make us feel this way?\n\nI don't know what I'm searching for\nBut I'll keep on searching till I find\"\n\nNote: These are the original lyrics as they appear on the album \"A Rush of Blood to the Head\". There may be slight variations in different versions or live performances."}
