{"k": "d4a9a2430369f41de920a56542770ee6", "t": "Here are the lyrics to \"Crazy\" by Gnarls Barkley:\n\nVerse 1:\nNow I don't claim nothin' but my own\nI'm a little too crazy, ain't no one gonna take that away from me\nI'm a little too crazy, ain't nobody gonna take that away from me\n\nChorus:\nYou're so fine you blow my mind\nHee hee, and it's all the time\nYou're so fine you blow my mind\nHee hee, and it's all the time\n\nVerse 2:\nI'm a little too crazy, ain't nobody gonna take that away from me\nI'm a little too crazy, ain't nobody gonna take that away from me\n\nChorus:\nYou're so fine you blow my mind\nHee hee, and it's all the time\nYou're so fine you blow my mind\nHee hee, and it's all the time\n\nBridge:\nI'm a little too crazy, ain't nobody gonna take that away from me\nI'm a little too crazy, ain't nobody gonna take that away from me\n\nChorus:\nYou're so fine you blow my mind\nHee hee, and it's all the time\nYou're so fine you blow my mind\nHee hee, and it's all the time"}
