{"k": "83c6f1cc930c74559331203a9025ebb3", "t": "Here are the lyrics to \"Crazy\" by Gnarls Barkley:\n\nVerse 1:\nGo to the edge of the world and back\nTell me you'll be loving me still when I'm old\nI don't care, I wish they all could see her make a fool of me\nWish they all could see her make a fool of me\n\nChorus:\n'Cause you're crazy, baby\nYou're crazy, baby\nYou're crazy, baby\nYou're crazy, baby\n\nVerse 2:\nGo to the edge of the world and back\nTell me you'll be loving me still when I'm old\nI don't care, I wish they all could see her make a fool of me\nWish they all could see her make a fool of me\n\nChorus:\n'Cause you're crazy, baby\nYou're crazy, baby\nYou're crazy, baby\nYou're crazy, baby\n\nBridge:\nGo to the edge of the world and back\nTell me you'll be loving me still when I'm old\nI don't care, I wish they all could see her make a fool of me\nWish they all could see her make a fool of me\n\nChorus:\n'Cause you're crazy, baby\nYou're crazy, baby\nYou're crazy, baby\nYou're crazy, baby"}
