{"k": "dbdc73105d1f48aa0fa6fa777ae4a4be", "t": "Here are the lyrics to \"Umbrella\" by Rihanna (feat. Jay-Z):\n\n[Chorus]\nWhen the sun shines, we'll shine together\nTold you I'll be here forever\nYou can stand under my umbrella\nYou can stand under my umbrella, ella, ella, eh, eh, eh\n\n[Verse 1 - Rihanna]\nSayin', \"Don't stop, make it pop\"\nDJ's blowin' up the funk\nGive me that record back\nI wanna see you move like this\n\nAnd the boys and girls are joinin' in\nBoys take or leave us if you want my heart\nYou're gonna have to get it from the start\nI'm tellin' you, boy, be an umbrella\nYou can stand under my umbrella\nYou can stand under my umbrella, ella, ella, eh, eh, eh\n\n[Chorus]\nWhen the sun shines, we'll shine together\nTold you I'll be here forever\nYou can stand under my umbrella\nYou can stand under my umbrella, ella, ella, eh, eh, eh\n\n[Verse 2 - Jay-Z]\nI'm in for the long haul\nIf you're ready to take a fall\nAnd I know it's hard when you're livin' with the drama and the trauma\nBut hold your head up high and just remember we are goin' through this together\nYou can stand under my umbrella\nYou can stand under my umbrella, ella, ella, eh, eh, eh\n\n[Chorus]\nWhen the sun shines, we'll shine together\nTold you I'll be here forever\nYou can stand under my umbrella\nYou can stand under my umbrella, ella, ella, eh, eh, eh\n\n[Bridge - Rihanna]\nI'ma take a cup of ambition and put it in a blender\nAdd some hard work, dedication, and a little bit of humor\nAnd then I'll hit puree and make a smoothie out of it\nAnd that's the recipe for success, ain't no one gonna stop me\n\n[Chorus]\nWhen the sun shines, we'll shine together\nTold you I'll be here forever\nYou can stand under my umbrella\nYou can stand under my umbrella, ella, ella, eh, eh, eh"}
{"k": "e6c99e2f6c194ad0e0114ff72c8ca94a", "t": "Here are the lyrics to \"Umbrella\" by Rihanna (feat. Jay-Z):\n\n[Chorus]\nWhen the sun shines, we'll shine together\nTold you I'll be here forever\nYou can stand under my umbrella\nYou can stand under my umbrella, ella, ella, eh, eh, eh\n\n[Verse 1 - Rihanna]\nSayin', \"Don't stop, make it pop\"\nDJ's blowin' up the funk\nGive me that record back\nI wanna see you move like this\n\nAnd the boys and girls are joinin' in\nBoys take or leave us if you want my heart\nYou're gonna have to get it from the start\nI'm tellin' you, boy, be an umbrella\nYou can stand under my umbrella\nYou can stand under my umbrella, ella, ella, eh, eh, eh\n\n[Chorus]\nWhen the sun shines, we'll shine together\nTold you I'll be here forever\nYou can stand under my umbrella\nYou can stand under my umbrella, ella, ella, eh, eh, eh\n\n[Verse 2 - Jay-Z]\nI'm in for the long haul\nIf you're ready to take a fall\nAnd I know it's hard when you're livin' with the drama and the trauma\nBut hold your head up high and just remember we are goin' through this together\nYou can stand under my umbrella\nYou can stand under my umbrella, ella, ella, eh, eh, eh\n\n[Chorus]\nWhen the sun shines, we'll shine together\nTold you I'll be here forever\nYou can stand under my umbrella\nYou can stand under my umbrella, ella, ella, eh, eh, eh\n\n[Bridge - Rihanna]\nI'ma take a cup of ambition and put it in a blender\nAdd some hard work, dedication, and a little bit of humor\nAnd then I'll hit puree and make a smoothie out of it\nAnd that's the recipe for success, ain't no one gonna stop me\n\n[Chorus]\nWhen the sun shines, we'll shine together\nTold you I'll be here forever\nYou can stand under my umbrella\nYou can stand under my umbrella, ella, ella, eh, eh, eh"}
{"k": "d243990a3ccaba02fa18bf822f7641ec", "t": "Here are the lyrics to \"Umbrella\" by Rihanna (feat. Jay-Z):\n\n[Chorus]\nWhen the sun shines, we'll shine together\nTold you I'll be here forever\nYou can stand under my umbrella\nYou can stand under my umbrella, ella, ella, eh, eh, eh\n\n[Verse 1 - Rihanna]\nSayin', \"Don't stop, make it pop\"\nDJ's blowin' up the funk\nGive me that record back\nI wanna see you move like this\n\nAnd the boys and girls are joinin' in\nBoys take or leave us if you want my heart\nYou're gonna have to get it from the start\nI'm tellin' you, boy, be an umbrella\nYou can stand under my umbrella\nYou can stand under my umbrella, ella, ella, eh, eh, eh\n\n[Chorus]\nWhen the sun shines, we'll shine together\nTold you I'll be here forever\nYou can stand under my umbrella\nYou can stand under my umbrella, ella, ella, eh, eh, eh\n\n[Verse 2 - Jay-Z]\nI'm in for the long haul\nIf you're ready to take a fall\nAnd I know it's hard when you're livin' with the drama and the trauma\nBut hold your head up high and just remember we are goin' through this together\nYou can stand under my umbrella\nYou can stand under my umbrella, ella, ella, eh, eh, eh\n\n[Chorus]\nWhen the sun shines, we'll shine together\nTold you I'll be here forever\nYou can stand under my umbrella\nYou can stand under my umbrella, ella, ella, eh, eh, eh\n\n[Bridge - Rihanna]\nI'ma take a cup of ambition and put it in a blender\nAdd some hard work, dedication, and a little bit of humor\nAnd then I'll hit puree and make a smoothie out of it\nAnd that's the recipe for success, ain't no one gonna stop me\n\n[Chorus]\nWhen the sun shines, we'll shine together\nTold you I'll be here forever\nYou can stand under my umbrella\nYou can stand under my umbrella, ella, ella, eh, eh, eh"}
{"k": "0e8b58b6021e9eb04c95e69f3250cb28", "t": "Here are the lyrics to \"Umbrella\" by Rihanna (feat. Jay-Z):\n\n**Verse 1 - Rihanna**\nWhen the sun shines, we shine together\nTold you I'll be here forever\nSaid I'll always be your friend\nTook an oath, I'ma stick it out to the end\n\nNow that it's raining more than ever\nKnow that we have each other\nYou can stand under my umbrella, ella, ella, eh, eh, eh\nYou can stand under my umbrella, ella, ella, eh, eh, eh\n\n**Chorus**\nUmbrella, ella, ella, eh, eh, eh\nUmbrella, ella, ella, eh, eh, eh\n\n**Verse 2 - Jay-Z**\nI'm a little bit of everything\nYou're my umbrella, baby\nWhen the war has took its part\nMy heart is beating like a drum and a guitar\n\nNow that it's raining more than ever\nKnow that we have each other\nYou can stand under my umbrella, ella, ella, eh, eh, eh\nYou can stand under my umbrella, ella, ella, eh, eh, eh\n\n**Chorus**\nUmbrella, ella, ella, eh, eh, eh\nUmbrella, ella, ella, eh, eh, eh\n\n**Bridge - Rihanna & Jay-Z**\nWhen the war has took its part\nMy heart is beating like a drum and a guitar\nYou can stand under my umbrella, ella, ella, eh, eh, eh\nYou can stand under my umbrella, ella, ella, eh, eh, eh\n\n**Chorus**\nUmbrella, ella, ella, eh, eh, eh\nUmbrella, ella, ella, eh, eh, eh"}
