{"k": "205acc40d92eb98a782ecc2d6ef61253", "t": "Here are the lyrics to \"Viva La Vida\" by Coldplay:\n\nI used to rule the world\nSeas would rise when I gave the word\nNow in the morning I sleep alone\nSweep the streets I used to own\n\nI used to roll the dice, feel the fear in my enemies' eyes\nListen as the crowd would sing\nNow the old king is dead! Long live the king!\n\nOne minute I held the key, next the walls were closed on me\nOh whoa, oh whoa, oh whoa, oh whoa\n\nI used to roll the dice, feel the fear in my enemies' eyes\nListen as the crowd would sing\nNow the old king is dead! Long live the king!\n\nI know Saint Peter won't call my name\nNever an honest word\nBut that was when I ruled the world\n\nIt was a wicked and wild wish it to burn\nWe could've had it all, we could've had it all\n\nOne minute I held the key, next the walls were closed on me\nOh whoa, oh whoa, oh whoa, oh whoa\n\nI used to roll the dice, feel the fear in my enemies' eyes\nListen as the crowd would sing\nNow the old king is dead! Long live the king!\n\nIt was a wicked and wild wish it to burn\nWe could've had it all, we could've had it all\n\nOne minute I held the key, next the walls were closed on me\nOh whoa, oh whoa, oh whoa, oh whoa"}
