{"k": "3c4c8bf1a06ea619aa88994e852650c4", "t": "Here are the lyrics to \"Rolling in the Deep\" by Adele:\n\nWe could've had it all\nRolling in the deep\nYou had my heart inside your hands\nAnd you played it to the beat\n\nMy mistake, I gave you two strikes, you brought me down to my knees\nBut I'm not the one who's weak enough to break\nThe only thing I didn't give was up when we broke up\n\nI guess that I'm too busy chaining my heart in these chains\nThen I see your face and this pain and it's time to begin\nYou had my heart inside your hands\nAnd you played it to the beat\n\nWe could've had it all\nRolling in the deep\nYou had my heart inside your hands\nAnd you played it to the beat\n\nMy mistake, I gave you two strikes, you brought me down to my knees\nBut I'm not the one who's weak enough to break\nThe only thing I didn't give was up when we broke up\n\nI guess that I'm too busy chaining my heart in these chains\nThen I see your face and this pain and it's time to begin\n\nWe could've had it all\nRolling in the deep\nYou had my heart inside your hands\nAnd you played it to the beat\n\nYou had my heart inside your hands\nAnd you played it to the beat"}
