{"k": "80d954170a242ef2bf13faa3b2ecedc4", "t": "Here are the lyrics to \"Shape of You\" by Ed Sheeran:\n\nVerse 1:\nThe club isn't the best place to find a lover\nSo the bar is where I go\nMe and my friends at the table doing shots\nDrinking fast and then we talk slow\nYou come around and you never fail to make me smile\nAt least for a while\n\nChorus:\nOne week in, we let the story begin\nWe're going out on our first date tonight\nIt's four in the morning, the night is still young\nAnd I've got my eyes on you, yeah\nI'm caught up in your shape of you\nYou're the shape of my heart\n\nVerse 2:\nThe club isn't the best place to find a lover\nSo the bar is where I go\nMe and my friends at the table doing shots\nDrinking fast and then we talk slow\nYou come around and you never fail to make me smile\nAt least for a while\n\nChorus:\nOne week in, we let the story begin\nWe're going out on our first date tonight\nIt's four in the morning, the night is still young\nAnd I've got my eyes on you, yeah\nI'm caught up in your shape of you\nYou're the shape of my heart\n\nBridge:\nThe club isn't the best place to find a lover\nSo the bar is where I go\nMe and my friends at the table doing shots\nDrinking fast and then we talk slow\nYou come around and you never fail to make me smile\nAt least for a while\n\nChorus:\nOne week in, we let the story begin\nWe're going out on our first date tonight\nIt's four in the morning, the night is still young\nAnd I've got my eyes on you, yeah\nI'm caught up in your shape of you\nYou're the shape of my heart\n\nOutro:\nOne week in, we let the story begin\nWe're going out on our first date tonight\nIt's four in the morning, the night is still young\nAnd I've got my eyes on you, yeah\nI'm caught up in your shape of you\nYou're the shape of my heart"}
