{"k": "2840cbbc205224d99a138c5b164e821c", "t": "Here are the lyrics to \"Shape of You\" by Ed Sheeran:\n\nThe club isn't the best place to find a lover\nSo the bar is where I go\nMe and my friends at the table doing shots\nDrinking fast and then we talk slow\n\nCome on now, follow my lead\nCome care about you, let's go\nLook how she's dancing in the crowd\nAnd all my hormones around you\n\nOne week in we let the story begin\nWe're keeping the thrill, living life on the edge\nMy one week in heaven, I'm so high\nI must've died and gone to heaven\n\nCome on now, follow my lead\nCome care about you, let's go\nLook how she's dancing in the crowd\nAnd all my hormones around you\n\nOne week in we let the story begin\nWe're keeping the thrill, living life on the edge\nMy one week in heaven, I'm so high\nI must've died and gone to heaven\n\nCome on now, follow my lead\nCome care about you, let's go\nLook how she's dancing in the crowd\nAnd all my hormones around you\n\nOne week in we let the story begin\nWe're keeping the thrill, living life on the edge\nMy one week in heaven, I'm so high\nI must've died and gone to heaven\n\nCome on now, follow my lead\nCome care about you, let's go\nLook how she's dancing in the crowd\nAnd all my hormones around you\n\nOne week in we let the story begin\nWe're keeping the thrill, living life on the edge\nMy one week in heaven, I'm so high\nI must've died and gone to heaven\n\nNote: These are the original lyrics as they appear on the album \"\u00f7\" (Divide). There may be slight variations in different versions or live performances of the song."}
