{"k": "52e231b0031dd2ac8768c08e774abfb4", "t": "Here are the lyrics to \"Bad Guy\" by Billie Eilish:\n\nYou like that, don't you?\nDon't you, don't you, don't you?\n\nI'm a bad guy\nI'm a bad guy\nI'm a bad guy\nI'm a bad guy\n\nYou're a good girl\nCan't be bought\nAll of the boys think she's a toy\nJust because she wears nothin' but her sauce\n\nAnd if she brings her West Coast friends, they'll be like \"Oh, what a night\"\nBut we'll be smokin' in the boys' club 'til we run out of time\nSo she plays it cool, but I can see through\nShe's just a bad guy, yeah, yeah, yeah\n\nYou like that, don't you?\nDon't you, don't you, don't you?\n\nI'm a bad guy\nI'm a bad guy\nI'm a bad guy\nI'm a bad guy\n\nYou're a good girl\nCan't be bought\nAll of the boys think she's a toy\nJust because she wears nothin' but her sauce\n\nAnd if she brings her West Coast friends, they'll be like \"Oh, what a night\"\nBut we'll be smokin' in the boys' club 'til we run out of time\nSo she plays it cool, but I can see through\nShe's just a bad guy, yeah, yeah, yeah\n\nYou like that, don't you?\nDon't you, don't you, don't you?\n\nI'm a bad guy\nI'm a bad guy\nI'm a bad guy\nI'm a bad guy"}
