 have had the right connections, and to have been part of the right scene. And they were lucky to have had the chance to take advantage of all these opportunities.\n\nSo what does this tell us about the nature of success? It tells us that it's not just a matter of individual talent or hard work - although those things are certainly important. It also tells us that success is often the result of a combination of factors, including cultural and historical context, luck, and being part of the right network. And it reminds"}
