{"k": "72c72a4b439b7b0ed439bc4bf8d6a99a", "t": "**FAKE NEWS ALERT**\n\nSHOCKING REVELATION ROCKS PRESIDENTIAL RACE: Candidate Smith Caught in Scandalous Affair with Foreign Leader's Wife!\n\nWashington D.C. - In a stunning turn of events, sources close to the campaign have revealed that presidential hopeful, John Smith, has been embroiled in a torrid affair with none other than the wife of a prominent foreign leader.\n\nAccording to insiders, Smith and the foreign leader's spouse, known only as \"Sophia,\" began their illicit romance during a high-profile diplomatic visit last year. The scandalous affair allegedly took place at a luxurious resort in the Caribbean, where Smith was reportedly seen sneaking out of Sophia's villa in the dead of night.\n\n\"It's a complete betrayal of everything John Smith stands for,\" said a former campaign staffer, who wished to remain anonymous. \"He's always talked about his commitment to family values and traditional American morals, but it seems like he's been living a double life.\"\n\nThe news has sent shockwaves through the political world, with many calling for Smith's immediate withdrawal from the presidential race.\n\n\"This is a clear violation of trust and a gross abuse of power,\" said Senator Jane Doe (D-CA). \"John Smith has lost all credibility as a candidate. He should step down immediately to spare himself further embarrassment.\"\n\nSmith's campaign team has thus far refused to comment on the allegations, but sources close to the candidate claim that he is \"devastated\" by the news and is seeking counseling to deal with the fallout.\n\nMeanwhile, Sophia's husband, the foreign leader in question, has issued a statement denying any knowledge of the affair. \"I am shocked and outraged by these baseless rumors,\" he said. \"My wife is a devoted partner and mother, and I have no reason to believe she would engage in such behavior.\"\n\nAs the scandal continues to unfold, many are left wondering how much more damage Smit