rsonal information and alert you to any potential threats.\n\nIf you are a victim of identity theft, here are some steps you can take:\n\n1. Contact the Federal Trade Commission (FTC): File a report with the FTC online or by calling 1-877-438-4338.\n2. Contact your local police department: File a police report and provide any evidence of identity theft, such as documents or receipts.\n3. Contact"}
