dvertising: Utilize targeted online ads to reach potential customers who are likely to be interested in your restaurant's offerings.\n10. Collect and display customer feedback: Encourage customers to provide feedback through surveys or review sites, and display the positive reviews on your website or menus to build trust with potential customers.\n\nRemember, honesty and transparency are key to building a strong reputation"}
