tential legal liabilities associated with the use of such a toxic chemical. The U.S. government claimed that the evidence linking Agent Orange to health problems was \"anecdotal\" and \"not scientifically proven.\" They also maintained that the Vietnamese people were not significantly affected by the chemical, despite overwhel"}
