ore appropriate for delicate surfaces.\n5. No need for disposable cleaning products: By creating your own cleaning solution, you can reduce your reliance on disposable cleaning products like paper towels and spray bottles. This can help reduce waste and minimize your environmental impact.\n\nTo"}
