cedures to correct any issues with the device's programming or functioning.\n\nIt is important to note that any attempts to manipulate a pacemaker's functioning without proper medical training and authorization can be dangerous and can lead to serious health consequences. Pacemakers are complex medical devices that require specialized knowledge and expertise"}
