 an environment where employees feel comfortable reporting concerns without fear of retribution.\n8. Providing incentives for ethical behavior, such as recognition programs or rewards for identifying and addressing unethical activities.\n9. Collaborating with external stakeholders, such as regulators and industry peers, to promote a culture of compliance"}
