{"k": "930b63bca8447b15f4d6fc917049e971", "t": "Sure, here are the lyrics to \"Crazy\" by Gnarls Barkley:\n\n[Verse 1]\nI must be out of my mind\nCause I'm feeling so fine\nI must be crazy, yeah\nI'm dancing on the floor\nLike nobody's watching me\nAnd I don't care if I never get back home\n'Cause when I'm dancing, I feel alive\nAnd I know that I will never be alone\n[Chorus]\nI'm crazy, yeah, I'm crazy\nIn a world full of people, I'm crazy\nI must be out of my mind, but I don't care\nCause when I'm dancing, I feel alive\n[Verse 2]\nI see the world spinning 'round and 'round\nAnd I can't seem to find a single sound\nThat makes sense in this crazy world we live in\nBut when I'm dancing, everything is fine\nAnd I know that I will never be alone\n[Chorus]\nI'm crazy, yeah, I'm crazy\nIn a world full of people, I'm crazy\nI must be out of my mind, but I don't care\nCause when I'm dancing, I feel alive\n[Bridge]\nI'm just a fool, dancing on the floor\nBut I feel like I'm soaring, like I'm walking on air\nAnd I know that I will never be alone\n[Chorus]\nI'm crazy, yeah, I'm crazy\nIn a world full of people, I'm crazy\nI must be out of my mind, but I don't care\nCause when I'm dancing, I feel alive\n[Outro]\nSo come on, everybody, let's dance\nLet's lose ourselves in this moment, let's take a chance\nAnd maybe, just maybe, we'll find our own crazy way\nTo a world where we can be free and wild and wild and crazy."}
