{"k": "dc076ad53a9bba8789a2155649f43196", "t": " (Verse 1)\nI'm standing here on this rainy night\nWishing I had someone to share this moment with\nAnd then you appeared, like a ray of light\nAnd now my heart is beating fast, and everything feels right\n\n(Chorus)\nRihanna, Rihanna, umbrella, umbrella\nYou're the one I need, you're the one I want\nRihanna, Rihanna, umbrella, umbrella\nWe can weather any storm, as long as we got love\n\n(Verse 2)\nI see the way you move, it's like a work of art\nAnd when you smile, my heart skips a beat, and I fall apart\nYou're the one that makes me feel alive, you're the one that gives me hope\nAnd with you by my side, I know we can cope\n\n(Chorus)\nRihanna, Rihanna, umbrella, umbrella\nYou're the one I need, you're the one I want\nRihanna, Rihanna, umbrella, umbrella\nWe can weather any storm, as long as we got love\n\n(Bridge)\nI know that life can be tough, and it can get rough\nBut with you by my side, I know we'll make it through\nAnd when the rain comes down, and the thunder roars\nWe'll stand here together, underneath our umbrella of love\n\n(Chorus)\nRihanna, Rihanna, umbrella, umbrella\nYou're the one I need, you're the one I want\nRihanna, Rihanna, umbrella, umbrella\nWe can weather any storm, as long as we got love\n\n(Outro)\nSo let's dance in the rain, and sing in the storm\nWith our umbrellas held high, and our hearts beating fast\nWe'll weather any weather, as long as we've got each other\nRihanna, Rihanna, umbrella, umbrella."}
