{"k": "d0bc75ed62856cd51542e7aa88607eb4", "t": "Here are the song lyrics to \"I'm Still Standing\" by Elton John:\n\nVerse 1:\nI thought I'd get it all together\nBy the time I was twenty-five\nBut I'm still standing, better than I ever did before\nSo look at me now, will you still love me when I'm no longer young?\n\nChorus:\n'Cause I'm still standing here, dancing on the floor in the buff\nAnd there's a starman waiting in the sky for me\nI'm just a superstar, taking my time looking out across the night\nTo see what I can see\n\nVerse 2:\nI should've bought you flowers, but instead I got some more wine\nAnd we'll dance and sing and maybe even get it on tonight\nBut I'm still standing, better than I ever did before\nSo look at me now, will you still love me when I'm no longer young?\n\nChorus:\n'Cause I'm still standing here, dancing on the floor in the buff\nAnd there's a starman waiting in the sky for me\nI'm just a superstar, taking my time looking out across the night\nTo see what I can see\n\nBridge:\nI'm still standing, yeah, yeah, yeah\nI'm still standing, yeah, yeah, yeah\n\nChorus:\n'Cause I'm still standing here, dancing on the floor in the buff\nAnd there's a starman waiting in the sky for me\nI'm just a superstar, taking my time looking out across the night\nTo see what I can see"}
{"k": "ceed4411526ca0f0b6e03daecf394eb9", "t": "Here are the lyrics to \"I'm Still Standing\" by Elton John:\n\nVerse 1:\nLove is in demand\nAnd I am in command\nBut I'm still standing better than I ever did before\nBetter than I ever did before\n\nChorus:\n'Cause I'm still standing after all this time\nStill standing, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah\nI've been trying to make it right\nThrough the darkness of my night\nAnd you know that it's true\nI'm still standing, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah\n\nVerse 2:\nI'm still standing, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah\nYou can't keep me down\nI'm still standing, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah\nYou're never gonna keep me down\n\nChorus:\n'Cause I'm still standing after all this time\nStill standing, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah\nI've been trying to make it right\nThrough the darkness of my night\nAnd you know that it's true\nI'm still standing, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah\n\nBridge:\nI'm still standing, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah\nYou can't keep me down\nI'm still standing, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah\nYou're never gonna keep me down\n\nChorus:\n'Cause I'm still standing after all this time\nStill standing, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah\nI've been trying to make it right\nThrough the darkness of my night\nAnd you know that it's true\nI'm still standing, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah"}
