{"k": "4bfe7c3d42f750418497711e0ce2a51f", "t": "Here are the song lyrics to \"Burning Down the House\" by Talking Heads:\n\nPeople on the street, looking up above\nAre waiting to hear what they've been told is great\nThey're stepping out in line, as the line cuts back in time\nAnd the flames, the flames, the flames, the flames\n\nHe's getting mad, he's getting angry\nHe's getting ready to get it on\nHe's getting mad, he's getting angry\nHe's getting ready to get it on\n\nPeople on the street, looking up above\nAre waiting to hear what they've been told is great\nThey're stepping out in line, as the line cuts back in time\nAnd the flames, the flames, the flames, the flames\n\nHe's burning down the house\nHe's burning down the house\nHe's burning down the house\nHe's burning down the house\n\nPeople on the street, looking up above\nAre waiting to hear what they've been told is great\nThey're stepping out in line, as the line cuts back in time\nAnd the flames, the flames, the flames, the flames\n\nHe's getting mad, he's getting angry\nHe's getting ready to get it on\nHe's getting mad, he's getting angry\nHe's getting ready to get it on\n\nPeople on the street, looking up above\nAre waiting to hear what they've been told is great\nThey're stepping out in line, as the line cuts back in time\nAnd the flames, the flames, the flames, the flames\n\nHe's burning down the house\nHe's burning down the house\nHe's burning down the house\nHe's burning down the house"}
{"k": "79e45b846eb5cef35cc16c914d1be99f", "t": "Here are the lyrics to the verses of \"Burning Down the House\" by Talking Heads:\n\nVerse 1:\nThese are the things I can do\nA happy historical brush fire\nI'll take you down the only road we have to walk on\nYou're going to burn, gonna set your night on fire\n\nVerse 2:\nWhat's left unsaid is often what gets in the way\nThe time has come to say who's going to get it first\nAnd I don't know if you've been told\nBut I'm not gonna be the one to take the blame\n\nLet me know if you'd like me to help with anything else!"}
