{"k": "1d35af7767039494eca5b30604ef5bfd", "t": "Here are the lyrics to \"Burning Down the House\" by Talking Heads:\n\nSpecial effects\nAt the video store\nI find myself alone\nWith a thousand memories\nLeft to sift through\n\nShe here but she's gone again\nYou know, I like to think that I'm something more than just a pretty face\nBut you can't get what you want 'til you know what you want\nAnd it don't make no difference anyway\n\nBurning down the house\nBurning down the house\nBurning down the house\nBurning down the house\n\nShe's talking in her sleep\nTalking in her sleep\nTalking in her sleep\nTalking in her sleep\n\nYou know, I like to think that I'm something more than just a pretty face\nBut you can't get what you want 'til you know what you want\nAnd it don't make no difference anyway\n\nBurning down the house\nBurning down the house\nBurning down the house\nBurning down the house\n\nI'll take you to the place where we first met\nWhere I fell in love with you, and I knew right then\nThat I had to get you, and I knew that I could\nAnd it don't make no difference anyway\n\nBurning down the house\nBurning down the house\nBurning down the house\nBurning down the house"}
