{"k": "e1323c3396fc9439fd74c7bd829b601f", "t": "Here are the lyrics to \"Losing My Religion\" by R.E.M.:\n\nLyrics:\nMet him in the park that sunny day\nHe was so much older then\nI never noticed that before\nLooked at him and he looked at me\n\"What does this guy know?\nDidn't look like he knew it was a sin\nSo why'd he bring me along?\nThe other night I had a vision, yeah\nI saw right through you\nAnd the things you do\nYou're so much older than I\nAnd your friends are all invincible\nYour generation's got it in for ya\n\nWell, they're out to get ya\nBetter stay away from them\nIt'll keep you in stitches\nJust remember what he said\nHe said, \"I didn't know him well\"\nBut still you took him home\nIn a couple of hours you finally hit the floor\nAnd she's talking to him and he's talking to her\nAnd they're talking to each other\nAnd the rain exploded with a telephone ringing\nAnd I'm whispering apologies\nTo the god that I forgot\nI don't believe that what he said was true\nWhen he said, \"For every man who fall, another will rise\"\nTo take his place, another man\nWith the same worn-out ideas\n\nLosing my religion\nLosing my religion\nLosing my religion\nLosing my religion\n\nWell, I can see myself\nIn a field of white\nAnd I can see myself\nIn a field of light\nAnd I can see myself\nIn a field of white\nAnd I can see myself\nIn a field of light\n\nLosing my religion\nLosing my religion\nLosing my religion\nLosing my religion"}
{"k": "6708309e1d52082660958101195e2f59", "t": "A classic! Here are the lyrics to \"Wonderwall\" by Oasis:\n\nToday is gonna be the day\nThat they're gonna throw it back to you\nBy now you should've somehow\nRealized what you gotta do\n\nI don't believe that anybody\nFeels the way I do about you now\n\nBackbeat, the word is on the street\nThat the fire in your soul is out\nAnd I'm just a poor boy, I need no sympathy\nBecause I'm already a man in black\n\nWell, today is gonna be the day\nThat they're gonna throw it back to you\nBy now you should've somehow\nRealized what you gotta do\n\nI don't believe that anybody\nFeels the way I do about you now\n\nAnd all the roads we have to walk are winding\nAnd all the lights that lead us there are blinding\nThere are many things that I would\nLike to say to you\nBut I'd just get pushed aside again\n\nWell, today is gonna be the day\nThat they're gonna throw it back to you\nBy now you should've somehow\nRealized what you gotta do\n\nI don't believe that anybody\nFeels the way I do about you now\n\nAnd all the roads we have to walk are winding\nAnd all the lights that lead us there are blinding\nThere are many things that I would\nLike to say to you\nBut I'd just get pushed aside again\n\nToday is gonna be the day\nThat they're gonna throw it back to you\nBy now you should've somehow\nRealized what you gotta do\n\nI don't believe that anybody\nFeels the way I do about you now\n\nAnd all the roads we have to walk are winding\nAnd all the lights that lead us there are blinding\nThere are many things that I would\nLike to say to you\nBut I'd just get pushed aside again\n\nWell, maybe you're gonna be the one that saves me\nAnd after all, you're my wonderwall\nToday is gonna be the day\nThat they're gonna throw it back to you\nBy now you should've somehow\nRealized what you gotta do\n\nI don't believe that anybody\nFeels the way I do about you now"}
