{"k": "91853f9145dfb25e3c05740bdbbd3855", "t": "Here are the song lyrics to \"Shape of You\" by Ed Sheeran:\n\nVerse 1:\nThe club isn't the best place to find a lover\nSo the bar is where I go\nMe and my friends at the table doing shots\nDrinking fast and then we talk slow\nYou come around and you never fail to make me smile\n\nChorus:\nAt least that's what I thought 'til last December\nStarted coming in again to get my records on\nAnd you can do whatever you like, but hey\nI'm not the kind of guy who settle down\n'Cause when she left me, I almost gave up hope\nBut then I saw her standing there and I just lost control\n\nVerse 2:\nSo I leave tonight or later still\nThough I might forget my name if she ever asks me again\nWhen it all falls apart, one like you can't repair\nAnd I'm not the kind of guy who settle down\n'Cause when she left me, I almost gave up hope\nBut then I saw her standing there and I just lost control\n\nChorus:\nAt least that's what I thought 'til last December\nStarted coming in again to get my records on\nAnd you can do whatever you like, but hey\nI'm not the kind of guy who settle down\n'Cause when she left me, I almost gave up hope\nBut then I saw her standing there and I just lost control\n\nBridge:\nYou're as smooth as tobacco smoke\nFlavors never tasted so sweet\nAnd I'm in a daze, but it's okay\nI'll be alright, I'll be alright\n\nChorus:\nAt least that's what I thought 'til last December\nStarted coming in again to get my records on\nAnd you can do whatever you like, but hey\nI'm not the kind of guy who settle down\n'Cause when she left me, I almost gave up hope\nBut then I saw her standing there and I just lost control\n\nOutro:\nThe shape of you will always be the shape of you\nYou're as smooth as tobacco smoke\nFlavors never tasted so sweet\nAnd I'm in a daze, but it's okay\nI'll be alright, I'll be alright"}
