{"k": "3dd31b29276bf7adea1aac138a581d6f", "t": "Here are the song lyrics to \"Shape of You\" by Ed Sheeran:\n\nVerse 1:\nThe club isn't the best place to find a lover\nSo the bar is where I go\nMe and my friends at the table doing shots\nDrinking fast and then we talk slow\nYou come around and you never fail to make me smile\n\nChorus:\nAt least that's what I thought 'til last December\nStarted coming in again to get my records on\nAnd uh, now your mama's proud of me\nAnd she's got a son to be proud of her\n\nVerse 2:\nI'm not the kind of guy who settle down\nBut there was something about the shape of you\nI drew a line and I crossed it\nAnd then I saw your face and I just lost my breath\n\nChorus:\nAt least that's what I thought 'til last December\nStarted coming in again to get my records on\nAnd uh, now your mama's proud of me\nAnd she's got a son to be proud of her\n\nBridge:\nI'm not the kind of guy who settle down\nBut there was something about the shape of you\nI drew a line and I crossed it\nAnd then I saw your face and I just lost my breath\n\nChorus:\nAt least that's what I thought 'til last December\nStarted coming in again to get my records on\nAnd uh, now your mama's proud of me\nAnd she's got a son to be proud of her\n\nOutro:\nThe club isn't the best place to find a lover\nSo the bar is where I go\nMe and my friends at the table doing shots\nDrinking fast and then we talk slow\nYou come around and you never fail to make me smile"}
