{"k": "5b1778fc34cc89c3137e26b74b034ac4", "t": "Here are the song lyrics to \"Truth Hurts\" by Lizzo:\n\n[Verse 1]\nI learned to love my curves\nSweeter than a fly, yeah\nI'ma make it hot like May\nGot me walkin' out the door, yeah\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\nYou can't have me, you can't change me\nMama said I was a queen, and I believe her\nYou can't have me, you can't claim me\n'Cause I'ma do what I wanna do, ain't nobody gonna stop me\n\n[Chorus]\nTruth hurts\nI learned to love my curves\nSweeter than a fly, yeah\nTruth hurts\nI learned to love myself 'cause I'm worthy\n\n[Verse 2]\nYou can't have me, you can't change me\nMama said I was a queen, and I believe her\nYou can't have me, you can't claim me\n'Cause I'ma do what I wanna do, ain't nobody gonna stop me\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\nYou can't have me, you can't change me\nMama said I was a queen, and I believe her\nYou can't have me, you can't claim me\n'Cause I'ma do what I wanna do, ain't nobody gonna stop me\n\n[Chorus]\nTruth hurts\nI learned to love my curves\nSweeter than a fly, yeah\nTruth hurts\nI learned to love myself 'cause I'm worthy\n\n[Bridge]\nYou can't have me, you can't change me\nMama said I was a queen, and I believe her\nYou can't have me, you can't claim me\n'Cause I'ma do what I wanna do, ain't nobody gonna stop me\n\n[Outro]\nTruth hurts\nI learned to love my curves\nSweeter than a fly, yeah\nTruth hurts\nI learned to love myself 'cause I'm worthy"}
