{"k": "51d11e4d8a8d6a64a5fa62dd5562190f", "t": "Here are the song lyrics to \"Waka Waka (This Time for Africa)\" by Shakira, featuring Freshlyground:\n\n**Verse 1 - Shakira**\nThis time for Africa\nThis time for Africa\nWhen we stand together\nWe can rock this world\nAnd in our hands we hold each other\nAnd that's the way it should be\n\n**Chorus - Shakira & Freshlyground**\nWaka waka eh, waka waka eh\nTsamina mina eh, tsamina mina eh\nThis time for Africa\nThis time for Africa\nWaka waka eh, waka waka eh\nTsamina mina eh, tsamina mina eh\n\n**Verse 2 - Freshlyground**\nWhen the drums start beating\nAnd the rhythm starts moving\nWe can rock this world\nAnd in our hands we hold each other\nAnd that's the way it should be\n\n**Chorus - Shakira & Freshlyground**\nWaka waka eh, waka waka eh\nTsamina mina eh, tsamina mina eh\nThis time for Africa\nThis time for Africa\nWaka waka eh, waka waka eh\nTsamina mina eh, tsamina mina eh\n\n**Bridge - Shakira & Freshlyground**\nWe can rock this world\nAnd in our hands we hold each other\nAnd that's the way it should be\nWhen we stand together\nWe can rock this world\nAnd in our hands we hold each other\nAnd that's the way it should be\n\n**Outro - Shakira & Freshlyground**\nWaka waka eh, waka waka eh\nTsamina mina eh, tsamina mina eh\nThis time for Africa\nThis time for Africa\nWaka waka eh, waka waka eh\nTsamina mina eh, tsamina mina eh\n\nThese lyrics are from the official FIFA World Cup 2010 song, which was performed by Shakira and Freshlyground."}
