{"k": "158b1c48228ad486eec1660a22cb3862", "t": "What an honor! Here's a draft of the lyrics for \"We Are One\", inspired by Pitbull's style:\n\n**Verse 1**\nI see the world through different eyes\nPeople from all walks, united we rise\nFrom the streets to the suites, we're all the same\nOne love, one dream, no matter where we came\n\n**Chorus**\nWe are one, we are strong\nTogether we can't be wrong\nWe are one, our voices loud\nUnited we stand, proud and proud\n\n**Verse 2**\nFrom the mountains to the sea\nWe're all connected, you see\nOur struggles, our triumphs, our stories told\nIn this moment, we're made of gold\n\n**Chorus**\nWe are one, we are strong\nTogether we can't be wrong\nWe are one, our voices loud\nUnited we stand, proud and proud\n\n**Bridge**\nLet's break down the walls, let love prevail\nEmbrace each other, without fail\nIn this world, we're all in this ride\nTogether, side by side\n\n**Chorus**\nWe are one, we are strong\nTogether we can't be wrong\nWe are one, our voices loud\nUnited we stand, proud and proud\n\n**Outro**\nSo let's raise our hands high\nAnd celebrate our unity\nIn this moment, we're free to be\nOne people, one world, that's just part of being me!\n\nPlease note that these lyrics are a draft and can be modified or improved upon. I hope you like the direction!"}
