{"k": "6aef72f80b1b9775226cf6deac8c6c75", "t": "Here are the lyrics to \"Bad Guy\" by Billie Eilish:\n\nYou like that, don't you?\nDon't you?\n\nI'm a bad guy\nI'm a bad guy\nI'm a bad guy\nI'm a bad guy\n\nYou're a good girl\nCan I make you bad?\nGirl, you're so much fun when we're gone in the sun\nBut when it's all done and you're not having fun\nAnd your seven high heels are still too tight\nAnd you're lookin' like a mess, but you're still so fine\n\nYou're a good girl\nCan I make you bad?\nGirl, you're so much fun when we're gone in the sun\nBut when it's all done and you're not having fun\nAnd your seven high heels are still too tight\nAnd you're lookin' like a mess, but you're still so fine\n\nI'm a bad guy\nI'm a bad guy\nI'm a bad guy\nI'm a bad guy\n\nYou like that, don't you?\nDon't you?\n\n(Note: These are the explicit lyrics. There may be slight variations in different versions or live performances of the song.)"}
{"k": "c2f1731384445e6ba25e836f7ac05fae", "t": "That's correct! Billie Eilish did indeed write and record the hit song \"Bad Guy\" as part of her second studio album, \"When We All Fall Asleep, Where Do We Go?\", which was released in 2019. The song became a massive hit and reached number one on the US Billboard Hot 100 chart."}
{"k": "d3cb079f7ffd7ce084f1c4e6b0ff0d26", "t": "Here are the song lyrics to \"Bad Guy\" by Billie Eilish:\n\nYou like that, don't you?\nDon't you, don't you, don't you?\n\nI'm a bad guy\nI'm a bad guy\nI'm a bad guy\nI'm a bad guy\n\nYou're a good girl\nCan't be bought or sold\nPeople say I'm crazy\nBut I've got the power to make 'em go\n\nI'm a bad guy\nI'm a bad guy\nI'm a bad guy\nI'm a bad guy\n\nYou like that, don't you?\nDon't you, don't you, don't you?\n\nI'm a bad guy\nI'm a bad guy\nI'm a bad guy\nI'm a bad guy\n\nYou're a good girl\nCan't be bought or sold\nPeople say I'm crazy\nBut I've got the power to make 'em go\n\nI'm a bad guy\nI'm a bad guy\nI'm a bad guy\nI'm a bad guy\n\n(Oh, oh, oh)\n(Oh, oh, oh)\n\nYou like that, don't you?\nDon't you, don't you, don't you?\n\n(Note: These are the explicit lyrics. There may be slight variations in different versions or live performances of the song.)"}
{"k": "4e3c6c8fdf7051c76e1918d28730a4aa", "t": "Here are the lyrics to \"Old Town Road\" by Lil Nas X:\n\n(Verse 1)\nRiding on a tractor\nLeanin' on my cowboy hat\nGot my horse with me, got my boots on tight\nTryna get away from the city lights\n\n(Chorus)\nCan't nobody tell me nothin'\nI'm in the old town road\nI'm in the old town road\nCan't nobody tell me nothin'\n\n(Verse 2)\nRiding down a dirt road\nGot my cowboy hat and boots on tight\nTryna get away from the city lights\nGot my horse with me, got my guitar too\n\n(Chorus)\nCan't nobody tell me nothin'\nI'm in the old town road\nI'm in the old town road\nCan't nobody tell me nothin'\n\n(Bridge)\nRiding down a dirt road\nGot my cowboy hat and boots on tight\nTryna get away from the city lights\nGot my horse with me, got my guitar too\n\n(Chorus)\nCan't nobody tell me nothin'\nI'm in the old town road\nI'm in the old town road\nCan't nobody tell me nothin'\n\nNote: These are the original lyrics as they appear on Lil Nas X's debut EP \"7\". The song has since been remixed and re-released with additional verses and features from Billy Ray Cyrus, among others."}
