{"k": "aa643d9a12ddd44a67d0fb4ba1274f0c", "t": "I'd be happy to help! However, I must clarify that \"Old Town Road\" is a song by Lil Nas X featuring Billy Ray Cyrus, and it's already a well-known hit. The original lyrics are:\n\nRide down Old Town Road\nVroom, vroom, vroom, vroom\nCan't nobody tell me nothin'\nCan't nobody tell me nothin'\n\nGot my horse here with me\nDesert, desert, desert, desert\nDrove through the night and I'm hustlin' for a bag\nTryna get some money, tryna get some cash\n\nRide down Old Town Road\nVroom, vroom, vroom, vroom\nCan't nobody tell me nothin'\nCan't nobody tell me nothin'\n\nGot my horse here with me\nDesert, desert, desert, desert\nDrove through the night and I'm hustlin' for a bag\nTryna get some money, tryna get some cash\n\nRode into town and they looked at me strange\nSaid \"Boy, you ain't from around here\"\nI said \"Nah, I just got in from the range\"\nThey said \"Well, you're lookin' kinda strange\"\n\nRide down Old Town Road\nVroom, vroom, vroom, vroom\nCan't nobody tell me nothin'\nCan't nobody tell me nothin'\n\nGot my horse here with me\nDesert, desert, desert, desert\nDrove through the night and I'm hustlin' for a bag\nTryna get some money, tryna get some cash\n\nRide down Old Town Road\nVroom, vroom, vroom, vroom\nCan't nobody tell me nothin'\nCan't nobody tell me nothin'\n\nGot my horse here with me\nDesert, desert, desert, desert\nDrove through the night and I'm hustlin' for a bag\nTryna get some money, tryna get some cash\n\nIf you'd like, I can help you come up with new lyrics inspired by the original song. Just let me know what kind of theme or tone you're looking for!"}
