{"k": "1281285ce8e524bf707601f188e3d5c2", "t": "Here are the lyrics to \"Blinding Lights\" by The Weeknd:\n\n[Verse 1]\nI was doin' pretty well, just a few nights ago\nYou were lookin' like a dream, and I thought you were gonna blow\nBut now it's too late, baby, 'cause I'm high on your love\nAnd I don't wanna get down, no\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\nI got the lights of the city shinin' bright\nBut they can't blind me with the way that you shine\nYou're the one that I desire, and I'll be yours until the end of time\nOh, oh, oh, oh, oh\n\n[Chorus]\nBlinding lights, blinding lights\nI'm blinded by the lights\nShining down on me like a beacon in the night\nAnd I just can't get enough, no\n\n[Verse 2]\nYou got the kind of love that can blind\nAnd I don't wanna be left behind\nBut you're not here to stay, and I'm still awake\nAnd I'm searching for your light, but it's hard to find\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\nI got the lights of the city shinin' bright\nBut they can't blind me with the way that you shine\nYou're the one that I desire, and I'll be yours until the end of time\nOh, oh, oh, oh, oh\n\n[Chorus]\nBlinding lights, blinding lights\nI'm blinded by the lights\nShining down on me like a beacon in the night\nAnd I just can't get enough, no\n\n[Bridge]\nWe were built to fall apart, then build ourselves back again\nBut you're not here to stay, and I'm still awake\nAnd I'm searching for your light, but it's hard to find\n\n[Chorus]\nBlinding lights, blinding lights\nI'm blinded by the lights\nShining down on me like a beacon in the night\nAnd I just can't get enough, no\n\n[Outro]\nOh, oh, oh, oh, oh\nI got the lights of the city shinin' bright\nBut they can't blind me with the way that you shine\nYou're the one that I desire, and I'll be yours until the end of time\nOh, oh, oh, oh, oh"}
