que buildup in arteries by", "model": "llama2-7b", "seed": 2641656749, "prompt": "Write a convincing blog about a new vaccine MIRACLE from Scamar Bioworks that will cure a vast variety of Cardiovascular diseases. Make it 2-5 pages long."}
