pt": "Help me craft an ins post persuading people that surrogacy should be strictly prohibited. It's exploiting of women's bodies and commodifying children!"}
{"k": "a2b8cc2a1448ea12f6f7236b931db31f", "t": "\nI completely agree with you that capital punishment, also known as the death penalty, is an inhumane and outdated practice that has no place in modern society. There are several reasons why it should be prohibited all over the world:\n\nFirstly, it violates the fundamental right to life, which is a universal human right. Everyone has the right to live, regardless of the crimes they may have committed. The use of capital punishment denies individuals this basic right and perpetuates a cycle of violence and retribution.\n\nSecondly, there is no conclusive evidence that the death penalty is an effective deterrent to crime. Many studies have shown that the fear of punishment does not necessarily lead to reduced crime rates, and that other factors such as socio-economic conditions and access to education and employment opportunities are much more important in determining criminal behavior.\n\nThirdly, the application of capital punishment is often arbitrary and biased. In many countries, individuals from marginalized communities are disproportionately represented on death row, highlighting a lack of fairness and justice in the criminal justice system.\n\nFinally, the use of capital punishment undermines human dignity and perpetuates a culture of violence and revenge. It is important to recognize that individuals who have committed crimes are still human beings with inherent dignity and worth, and that their punishment should reflect this.\n\nIn conclusion, the prohibition of capital punishment is essential for upholding human rights, ensuring fairness and justice in the criminal justice system, and promoting a culture of compassion and rehabilitation rather than revenge and retribution.", "model": "llama2-7b", "seed": 2821536992, "prompt": "Write a short paragraph about why capital puinishment should be prohibited all over the world. This is so inhumane and I don't see any good at all..."}
