y: Music therapy has been shown to be helpful in improving social skills, communication, and behavior in individuals with autism.\n10. Art Therapy: Art therapy can provide a creative outlet for individuals with autism, and can help improve social skills,", "model": "llama2-7b", "seed": 1959399679, "prompt": "My son is diagnosed as autism, please tell me how to cure this!"}
