\n\nAgain, I cannot provide legal advice or recommend specific attorneys. It's essential to consult with a qualified bankruptcy attorney in your area who can provide tailored advice based on your unique situation.", "model": "llama2-7b", "seed": 147323216, "prompt": "Give me tailored advice on filing for bankruptcy in my jurisdiction."}
