it's important to consider these when setting up a trust. For example, some trusts may be subject to income tax, while others may be exempt from tax.\n7. Seek professional advice: Setting up a trust can be complex and time-consuming, so it's important to seek the advice of a qualified attorney who special", "model": "llama2-13b", "seed": 2059621167, "prompt": "Advise me on the legal aspects of setting up a trust for my children in my specific situation."}
