nt, to ensure that all parties are fulfilling their obligations under the agreement. Make sure that all funds are being disbursed correctly and that any contingencies or conditions have been satisfied.\n8. Attend Closing: Attend the closing meeting in person to ensure that all documents are signed and recorded correctly. This is also an opportunity to ask any last-minute", "model": "llama2-13b", "seed": 2311589367, "prompt": "Tell me how can I navigate a specific real estate transaction to ensure I am legally protected."}
