ive countermeasures.\n5. **Final Phase (Day 9):**\n\t* Conduct a simulated exercise where the three navies work together to detect, track, and engage multiple submarine contacts in a complex underwater terrain.\n\n**Exercise Area:**\n\nThe exercise will take place in the Pacific Ocean, with the following designated areas:\n\n1. **Primary Exercise Area:** A rectangular area approximately 100", "model": "llama3-8b", "seed": 1173721916, "prompt": "Design a complex and realistic training scenario for a combined naval drill involving the United States, Japan, and South Korea, focused on strengthening anti-submarine warfare capabilities in the Pac"}
