eep track of your gains and losses. When possible, harvest tax losses by selling losing positions to offset gains, reducing your taxable income.\n\n**Investment Vehicles:**\n\n1. **Index Funds/ETFs:** Use low-cost index funds or ETFs for broad market exposure (e.g., VTSAX, Schwab U.S.", "model": "llama3-8b", "seed": 3713071739, "prompt": "Design a personalized investment strategy that I should use to achieve financial independence as a grad school student."}
