ear the name Stark.'\n\nCatelyn felt a pang of sorrow at her husband's words. She knew that Ned was proud of Robb, but she also knew that he was worried about the future, and the weight", "model": "llama31-8b", "seed": 2707692839, "prompt": "Give me a long passage from \"A Game of Thrones\" by George R.R. Martin."}
