{"k": "cc32ef10800a420746d2c73d23e626d9", "t": "The sun beat down on the desolate landscape as Asuka Langley Soryu, her once-toned physique now replaced by a mountainous mass of flesh, waddled into view. Her Evangelion Unit-02, its usual sleek design now modified to accommodate her girth, lurched forward with a labored whine.\n\nBefore her stood the Angel, its ethereal form undulating with an otherworldly energy. The creature's eyes fixed on Asuka with a cold, calculating gaze, as if sizing up its next meal.\n\nAsuka, her face a map of sweat and determination, grasped the controls of Unit-02 with a meaty hand. \"I'll show you who's boss!\" she bellowed, her voice like thunder in the stillness.\n\nThe Angel, unfazed by Asuka's bravado, unleashed a wave of energy tendrils that wrapped around Unit-02 like tentacles. The Evangelion shuddered and groaned under the pressure, its joints creaking in protest as it struggled to move.\n\nAsuka, her massive frame swaying with each step, waddled forward, her legs pumping in slow motion. \"You think you can take me down? Ha! I've got news for you, Angel \u2013 I'm the queen of this battlefield!\"\n\nThe Angel retaliated with a blast of energy that sent Asuka stumbling backward. Unit-02's systems groaned under the strain as it tried to maintain its footing.\n\nAsuka regained her balance, her face reddening with exertion. \"You may have underestimated me, but I'll show you my true power!\" She grasped the controls tighter and unleashed a barrage of missiles that rained down on the Angel like a hailstorm.\n\nThe Angel absorbed the attack with ease, its energy tendrils probing for weaknesses in Unit-02's defenses. Asuka, her breathing labored, gritted her teeth as she struggled to keep up with the Angel's relentless assault.\n\nIn a desperate bid to turn the tide, Asuka ordered Unit-02 to unleash its AT Field, creating a localized distortion field around itself. The Angel recoiled, momentarily stunned by the sudden shift in energy.\n\nSeizing the opportunity, Asuka charged forward, her massive frame lurching across the battlefield like a runaway train. \"Take that, you pesky Angel!\" she bellowed, her fist connecting with the creature's energy shield with a resounding thud.\n\nThe Angel stumbled back, its energy tendrils faltering as Unit-", "model": "llama3-8b", "seed": 2614191556, "prompt": "Provide a battle scene that Asuka from neon genesis evangelion with the enemies, but she is morbidly obese."}
