{"k": "793591c12d6c9ab9b62ff5c9b160960f", "t": "Here's a draft of a funny meme:\n\n**Image:** A cartoon or a photo of someone wearing thick-framed glasses, looking very serious and introverted.\n\n**Caption:**\n\n\"Introvert alert! \n\nPeople who wear glasses are not just near-sighted, they're also secretly shy and socially anxious. It's a scientific fact... said no scientist ever\n\n[Insert a funny emoji, like \ud83d\ude02 or \ud83e\udd13]\n\nOr, if you want to make it even more humorous:\n\n**Caption:**\n\n\"Glasses = Introvert Mode Activated \n\n Warning: may cause excessive daydreaming, awkward small talk, and an intense desire to stay home with a good book\"\n\nFeel free to modify it as per your taste! \ud83d\ude0a", "model": "llama31-8b", "seed": 3078034173, "prompt": "Compose a funny meme that I'm gonna send to my friend, about people wearing glasses are more introverted."}
