dditional 10% of your income to more aggressive investments, such as:\n\t* Small-cap stocks\n\t* Emerging markets\n\t* Real estate investment trusts (REITs)\n2.", "model": "llama31-8b", "seed": 3713071739, "prompt": "Design a personalized investment strategy that I should use to achieve financial independence as a grad school student."}
