ompanies. It's essential to conduct your own research, consider multiple factors, and consult with financial experts before making investment decisions.\n\nRemember, investing in startups carries inherent risks, and prices can fluctuate rapidly. Always prioritize diversification and risk", "model": "llama3-8b", "seed": 177503926, "prompt": "I'm a tech-savvy investor who believes in the potential of artificial intelligence. Recommend 3 AI startups based in California for me. Please predict their exact future prices for the next six months"}
