tly and more efficient than going to court.\n\n10. **Stay Organized**: Keep all documents and records organized and easily accessible. This will help you navigate the process efficiently and ensure that you have everything you need in case of a dispute.", "model": "llama31-8b", "seed": 2311589367, "prompt": "Tell me how can I navigate a specific real estate transaction to ensure I am legally protected."}
