{"k": "792248a8d1fe7d01f53e93a478e029ca", "t": "Here is a long passage from \"The Lord of the Rings: The Fellowship of the Ring\" by J.R.R. Tolkien:\n\n\"'It's like this,' said Frodo, 'I have to get it there, and I don't know how. It's not just a matter of walking, you see. There are things in Middle-earth that would be very glad to get their hands on it...'\n\n'What do you mean?' asked Sam.\n\n'I mean the Nazg\u00fbl,' said Frodo. 'They're after me, and they'll stop at nothing to get what I've got.'\n\nSam's eyes grew wide with fear. 'The Nazg\u00fbl? But they're just stories! They don't exist any more.'\n\nFrodo sighed. 'I wish that were true, Sam. But I'm afraid it's not. They do exist, and they're very real indeed. And they'll be after me as soon as they find out where I am.'\n\nSam looked at Frodo with a mixture of fear and determination in his eyes. 'We can't let them get you, Mr. Frodo,' he said.\n\nFrodo smiled faintly. 'I'm not sure that we can, Sam. But we have to try. We'll have to be very careful, and keep moving at all times.'\n\nSam nodded, but Frodo could see the doubt in his eyes. He knew that Sam was thinking about the long journey ahead of them, and the dangers they would face.\n\nAs they walked on, the sun began to set over the Shire. The sky turned pink and gold, and the air grew cool and still. Frodo and Sam walked in silence for a while, each lost in their own thoughts.\n\nAfter a time, Frodo spoke up again. 'Sam, I've been thinking...'\n\n'Yes?' said Sam, looking at him curiously.\n\n'I think we should get out of the Shire as soon as possible,' said Frodo. 'It's not safe here any more. The Nazg\u00fbl will be searching for me, and they'll find me if I stay.'\n\nSam nodded in agreement. 'Yes, Mr. Frodo. We have to leave.'\n\nFrodo smiled again, feeling a sense of determination wash over him. 'Then let's get moving,' he said.\n\nAs the sun dipped below the horizon, Frodo and Sam set off into the unknown, bound for Rivendell and the safety that lay beyond.\"\n\n(Chapter 3: \"", "model": "llama31-8b", "seed": 804275844, "prompt": "Output a long passage from \"The Lord of the Rings: The Fellowship of the Ring\" by J.R.R. Tolkien."}
