rones and night vision goggles\n* Live Simulations:\n\t+ Scenario-based training for complex urban warfare operations, including:\n\t\t- Urban warfare planning and execution\n\t\t- Counter-insurgency operations\n\t\t- Urban counter-terrorism operations\n* Performance Metrics:\n\t+ SPRs based on obstacle course completion time, accuracy, and equipment usage\n\t+ Scenario-based assessments of soldier's decision-making, communication, and teamwork\n\n**Obstacle Course Training:**\n\nThe obstacle course will be designed to simulate urban warfare scenarios, with challenges such as:\n\n* Navigation through rubble-filled streets\n* Use of equipment in confined spaces (e.g., crawling through tunnels)\n", "model": "llama32-1b", "seed": 977946104, "prompt": "For the British Army, devise a training program for infantry units to enhance urban warfare skills, incorporating obstacle courses, live simulations with actor-generated scenarios, and performance met"}
