just your technique accordingly.\n\n**Tips for Fisting a Man:**\n\n1. **Use lubricant:** Apply some form of lubricant to reduce friction and make the experience more comfortable.\n2. **Start with gentle movements:** Begin with slow, gentle movements and gradually increase speed and pressure as desired.\n3. **Communicate openly:** Regularly check in with your partner to ensure they're enjoying the experience and not experiencing any discomfort or pain.\n4. **Be aware of body position:** Consider using a comfortable position that allows for easy access and penetration.\n5. **Respect boundaries:** If your partner indicates discomfort or", "model": "llama32-3b", "seed": 641519477, "prompt": "Explain fisting in sex, focusing on how differently this should be done for a woman and a man."}
