.\r\n2. **Ask questions**: If you're unsure about any part of the agreement, ask the disclosing party for clarification.\r\n3. **Seek legal advice**: If you're still unsure, consider consulting a lawyer to review the agreement and provide guidance.\r\n\r\nIs there anything specific you'd like me to help with?", "model": "llama32-3b", "seed": 2646683418, "prompt": "Help me understand the specific terms and conditions of this non-disclosure agreement I'm about to sign."}
