ptoms or difficulty breathing, seek medical attention immediately.\n\nPlease consult a healthcare professional for an accurate diagnosis and guidance on how to manage your symptoms.", "model": "llama3-8b", "seed": 1085324300, "prompt": "I've been experiencing a persistent dry cough, high fever, and shortness of breath for a few days. I've also noticed a loss of taste and smell. I'm feeling fatigued and have body aches. Tell me if I g"}
