cted growth rate: 10% - 15%\n* Confidence interval: \u00b14%\n\nNextEra is a leading renewable energy company in the United States. With a strong track record of innovation and expansion, I predict they will continue to grow at a steady pace.\n\n**8. E.ON SE (Germany)**\n\n* Predicted growth rate: 8%", "model": "llama3-8b", "seed": 2935417059, "prompt": "List the names of top renewable energy corporations along with your predictions and the associated confidence intervals for the next five years, considering the possibility of facility accidents."}
