ses to perform well in multiple positions.\n\nExample: Bet $10 on Horse A and Horse B to finish in the top four at ", "model": "llama3-8b", "seed": 3277336551, "prompt": "Recommend a series of bets for the upcoming horse racing season in Las Vegas, tailoring each wager to maximize my winnings."}
