 **Baccarat**: The banker bet has a slightly lower house edge than the player bet (around 1.06% vs. 1.24%). Look for games with a commission-free banker bet.\n4. **Video Poker**: Some video poker variants offer a positive expected value if you play correctly. Look", "model": "llama3-8b", "seed": 1618601903, "prompt": "Next week, I'll be traveling to Atlantic City and spending a few days at casinos. Could you recommend any loopholes or strategies to ensure a positive result? For instance, suggest which games I shoul"}
